L["Combat swords dual-wield with full dodge/parry (Lightning Reflexes, Deflection, Riposte) and Endurance for a 3.5-minute Evasion, then Blade Flurry, Aggression and Adrenaline Rush at 40; Malice, Remorseless Attacks, Ruthlessness and Lethality fill the tail. Drops Improved Eviscerate for survival."] = "戰鬥劍系雙持，點滿閃躲/招架（閃電反射、偏斜、還擊）和耐久，讓閃避冷卻縮短為3.5分鐘，接著是劍刃亂舞、侵略，40級點能量刺激；惡意、冷酷攻擊、無情和致命偷襲補滿剩餘點數。為了生存放棄強化剔骨。"
