L["Daggers for leveling through dungeons: in a group you stand behind the mob, so Backstab works. Improved Eviscerate, Puncturing Wounds (Backstab crits and extra combo points) and Opportunity first, then Malice, Murder (many dungeon mobs are humanoid), Ruthlessness and Relentless Strikes, then Combat for Dual Wield Specialization, Blade Flurry for packs and Adrenaline Rush. Open with Ambush, Backstab to build, Eviscerate to finish; Blade Flurry when the tank holds two or more."] = "在地城中練功的匕首配置：組隊時你站在怪物背後，所以背刺可用。先點強化剔骨、刺傷（背刺致命一擊並額外獲得連擊點數）和伺機而動，接著是惡意、謀殺（許多地城怪物是人型生物）、無情和無情打擊，然後點戰鬥系的雙武器專精、對付成群怪的劍刃亂舞和能量刺激。以伏擊開場，背刺累積連擊點數，剔骨收尾；坦克穩住兩隻以上時開劍刃亂舞。"
L["Decimation"] = "屠虐"
L["Demonic Brand"] = "惡魔烙印"
L["Demonology with Soul Link for max-level PvP, played with the Voidwalker out. Demonic Embrace, Fel Vitality and Demonic Aegis raise your health and armor early, Improved Voidwalker makes the pet a sturdier sponge, and Soul Link at 30 sends 30% of every hit you take to it. Keep Fear and your DoTs on the target, let the Voidwalker hold enemy melee, use Fel Domination to bring a dead pet back fast, and swap to the Felhunter against casters (Spell Lock). Soul Link needs a point in Demonic Sacrifice; never use it."] = "用於滿級PvP的靈魂鏈結惡魔學識配置，帶虛空行者出場。惡魔之擁、惡魔活力和惡魔庇護在前期提高你的生命力和護甲，強化虛空行者讓寵物成為更耐打的肉盾，30級的靈魂鏈結把你受到的每次攻擊的30%轉給它。對目標保持恐懼術和DoT，讓虛空行者牽制敵方近戰，用惡魔支配快速召回死掉的寵物，對上施法者時換成地獄獵犬（法術封鎖）。靈魂鏈結需要在惡魔犧牲點一點；永遠不要使用它。"
