L["Cat Form for max-level PvP (Feral 43 / Restoration 8), with Heart of the Wild first and Natural Shapeshifter last. Feral Swiftness at 20 for a faster Cat, then Brutal Impact at 22 for a shorter Bash cooldown, Feral Charge at 25 to stop a caster or runner (Bear Form only), Shredding Attacks from 28 for cheap Shreds and Shifting Power at 45 to turn mana back into Energy. Opener: Prowl, Pounce, Shred from behind, then Ferocious Bite at five combo points; shift out of roots and snares."] = "用於滿級PvP的獵豹形態配置（野性戰鬥43 / 恢復8），先點野性之心，最後點自然變身。20級點野性迅捷讓獵豹更快，然後22級點野蠻衝撞縮短重擊冷卻，25級點野性衝鋒來攔住施法者或逃跑的人（僅限熊形態），28級起點撕碎攻擊讓撕碎更便宜，45級點Shifting Power把法力轉回能量。開場：潛伏、突襲、從背後撕碎，然後五點連擊點數時用兇猛撕咬；變身解除定身和減速。"
