L["Frost for leveling through dungeons: the single-target Frost talents ordered for groups. Frostbolt on bosses; once the tank holds a pack, Blizzard and Cone of Cold (Ice Shards makes their crits hit hard). Frost Nova if a mob comes for you. Let the tank get the pack first: AoE pulls threat fast."] = "在地城中練功的冰霜配置：單體冰霜天賦按組隊需求排序。首領用寒冰箭；坦克穩住一群怪後，用暴風雪和冰錐術（寒冰碎片讓它們的致命一擊打得很痛）。有怪衝向你時用冰霜新星。先讓坦克拉住整群怪：範圍法術很快就會吸走仇恨。"
L["Frost: AoE Leveling"] = "冰霜：範圍練功"
