L["Level-60 AoE farming on packs of 4-5 mobs, but risky: the Voidwalker holds the pack while you Rain of Fire, or you Hellfire in the middle with Soul Link passing part of the damage you take to the demon. Demonology first: Demonic Embrace, Improved Voidwalker at 24-25, Soul Link at 30 (after its point in Demonic Sacrifice) and Master Demonologist at 35-39, then Destruction: Molten Skin for less damage taken, Cataclysm for cheaper spells, Ruin and Agonizing Flames for damage. Keep Healthstones handy and don't pull more than 5."] = "60級範圍刷怪，一次4-5隻，但有風險：讓虛空行者抓住整群怪你放火焰之雨，或你站在中間放地獄烈焰，靠靈魂鏈結把你受到的部分傷害轉給惡魔。先點惡魔學識系：惡魔之擁，24-25級點強化虛空行者，30級點靈魂鏈結（在點完它需要的惡魔犧牲之後），35-39級點惡魔學識大師，然後點毀滅系：熔火之膚減少受到的傷害，災變讓法術更便宜，毀滅和苦惱之焰增加傷害。備好治療石，一次別拉超過5隻。"
L["Level-60 AoE farming with a one-hander and shield (Prot 38 / Ret 13): gather 15-20 normal mobs, drop Consecration, keep Holy Shield up and let Retribution Aura (30 + 10% of your spell power on every hit you take) do most of the killing. Holy Shield and Templar's Bulwark are what let you pull big packs; Improved Seal of Fury and Shield Specialization keep your mana going; Pursuit of Justice gathers the next pack faster. Spell power is your best stat by far, then block, dodge, parry and Defense."] = "60級範圍刷怪，使用單手武器加盾牌（防護38 / 懲戒13）：聚集15-20隻普通怪，放奉獻，保持神聖之盾，讓懲戒光環（你每次被擊中造成30 + 你法術能量10%的傷害）負責大部分擊殺。神聖之盾和聖殿騎士之壁壘讓你能拉大群怪；強化憤怒聖印和盾牌專精維持你的法力；正義追擊讓你更快聚集下一群怪。法術能量是你最好的屬性，遙遙領先，其次是格擋、閃躲、招架和防禦。"
L["Level-60 AoE farming with a one-hander and shield: Protection kills small packs about as fast as Arms or Fury while taking far less damage, so it hardly needs to eat. Gather a pack, Thunder Clap and Demoralizing Shout, Revenge and Shield Slam on cooldown, Cleave with spare rage. Shield Specialization, Improved Revenge, Improved Thunder Clap and Master of Defense first, then Cruelty and Deflection, Anticipation, Last Stand at 44, Concussion Blow at 50, Bastion, then Shield Slam at 57."] = "60級使用單手武器和盾牌的範圍刷怪：防護擊殺小群怪的速度和武器或狂怒差不多，但承受的傷害少得多，所以幾乎不需要吃東西。聚集一群怪，使用雷霆一擊和挫志怒吼，冷卻好就用復仇和盾牌猛擊，多餘的怒氣用順劈斬。先點盾牌專精、強化復仇、強化雷霆一擊和防禦大師，然後殘忍和偏斜、預知，44級點破釜沉舟，50級點震盪猛擊，接著堡壘，然後57級點盾牌猛擊。"
L["Level-60 AoE farming: gather a big pack, keep it slowed with Improved Blizzard and Permafrost, Frost Nova to get distance (Cold Snap for a second Nova), then Blizzard it down with Cone of Cold between. Precision and Ice Shards first, Improved Blizzard from 21, Shatter, then Improved Cone of Cold at 30, Ice Barrier at 40, then Arcane Concentration and Accelerant, with Ice Block as the last point. Frost Channeling and Arcane Concentration keep drinking short; Crit, Intellect and Mp5 matter more than Spell Power here."] = "60級範圍刷怪：聚集一大群怪，用強化暴風雪和極寒冰霜保持減速，用冰霜新星拉開距離（急速冷卻可再放一次新星），然後用暴風雪清掉，中間穿插冰錐術。先點精確和寒冰碎片，21級起點強化暴風雪，接著碎冰，然後30級點強化冰錐術，40級點寒冰護體，接著秘法專注和Accelerant，最後一點給寒冰屏障。冰霜導能和秘法專注讓喝水時間更短；在這裡致命一擊、智力和每5秒回魔比法術能量更重要。"
L["Level-60 Shadow farming on packs of 4-5 mobs: Shadow Word: Pain on each, Devouring Plague (Devouring Contagion spreads it when a mob dies), Power Word: Shield (Soul Warding: shorter cooldown) and Psychic Scream to fear them off you (Improved Psychic Scream), Vampiric Embrace and Spirit Tap to recover. Risky: about 225 mobs an hour in our rough model (single-target about 120), but a pack out-damages your health unless you chain fears and shields well. Start with 3 mobs."] = "60級暗影刷怪，一次4-5隻：每隻上暗言術：痛，噬靈瘟疫（吞噬疫病會在怪物死亡時擴散它），真言術：盾（靈魂結界：冷卻更短），用心靈尖嘯把怪恐懼開（強化心靈尖嘯），吸血鬼的擁抱和精神分流用於恢復。有風險：在我們的粗略模型中每小時約225隻（單體約120隻），但除非恐懼和護盾銜接得好，一群怪的傷害會超過你的生命力。從3隻開始。"
L["Level-60 pack farming as a shield tank: pull about 4 normal mobs, drop Magma Totem, Fire Nova on cooldown, Lightning Shield and Flame Shock, Rockbiter Weapon on your one-hander. Survival over threat: Toughness, Anticipation, Guardian Totems and Improved Reincarnation instead of Stormstrike. About 170 mobs an hour in our rough model against 78 single-target as Enhancement; 5 mobs is about the limit without healing mid-fight. Levels as a tank (mana talents first)."] = "以盾牌坦克身分在60級刷成群的怪：拉約4隻普通怪，放熔岩圖騰，冷卻好就放火焰新星，閃電之盾和烈焰震擊，單手武器上石化武器。生存優先於仇恨：以堅韌、預知、守護圖騰和強化復生取代風暴打擊。在我們的粗略模型中每小時約170隻，增強單刷則為78隻；不在戰鬥中補血的話，5隻大約是極限。以坦克身分練功（法力天賦優先）。"
