L["Marksmanship for level-60 PvP, with Survival for traps and staying alive. Improved Concussive Shot gives Concussive Shot a 20% chance to stun, and Lethal Attacks, Careful Aim and Mortal Shots give you burst. Scatter Shot at 30 is your panic button: scatter, step away, shoot. Then Entrapment (traps root whoever triggers them), Deterrence at 41, Surefooted against slows and Clever Traps for a longer Freezing Trap. Open with Freezing Trap or Concussive Shot, keep your distance with Wing Clip and Disengage. Keep your pet close: it dies quickly against players."] = "用於60級PvP的射擊配置，搭配生存系的陷阱和保命天賦。強化震盪射擊讓震盪射擊有20%機率使目標昏迷，致命攻擊、仔細瞄準和致死射擊提供爆發。30級的驅散射擊是你的救命按鈕：驅散、退開、射擊。然後點誘捕（陷阱會定身觸發它的人），41級點威懾，穩固對抗減速，靈巧陷阱讓冰凍陷阱持續更久。用冰凍陷阱或震盪射擊開場，用摔絆和逃脫保持距離。讓寵物待在身邊：牠面對玩家時很快就會死。"
