L["Frost for level-60 open-world PvP (48 Frost / 3 Fire). Improved Frostbolt and Precision speed up Frostbolt, Incineration sharpens Ice Lance, and Frostbite, Improved Frost Nova and Ice Block give you root, freeze and an emergency escape. Shatter comes at 29, so a Nova or Frostbite freeze followed by Ice Lance and Frostbolt is your burst; later Fingers of Frost adds more frozen hits, Winter's Chill a stronger Cone of Cold, Cold Snap resets Nova and Ice Block, and Ice Barrier stops pushback while it holds. Keep range with Nova and Blink, and Ice Block when a melee class or a group catches you."] = "用於60級開放世界PvP的冰霜配置（冰霜48 / 火焰3）。強化寒冰箭和精確加快寒冰箭，焚化強化冰霜長矛，霜寒刺骨、強化冰霜新星和寒冰屏障提供定身、冰凍和緊急脫身。碎冰在29級取得，所以用新星或霜寒刺骨冰凍後接冰霜長矛和寒冰箭就是你的爆發；之後冰霜之指提供更多對冰凍目標的攻擊，深冬之寒強化冰錐術，急速冷卻重置新星和寒冰屏障，寒冰護體在持續期間防止施法被推遲。用新星和閃現術保持距離，被近戰職業或一群人追上時用寒冰屏障。"
L["Pure Frost: Improved Frostbolt and Elemental Precision for speed, then Frostbite plus Ice Lance and Shatter for free-freeze burst, Frost Channeling for short drinks, Ice Barrier at 40. Nova kiting and Frostbite freezes handle an accidental second mob; AoE/Fire cost either survival or mana."] = "純冰霜：強化寒冰箭和元素準確提高速度，接著是霜寒刺骨加上冰霜長矛和碎冰打出免費冰凍爆發，冰霜導能縮短喝水時間，40級點寒冰護體。冰霜新星放風箏和霜寒刺骨的冰凍能應付意外多出的第二隻怪；範圍/火焰配置則要犧牲生存或法力。"
L["Restoration healer for PvP (Restoration 46 / Feral 5). Nature's Focus first, so damage doesn't cost you casts, then Naturalist for a shorter Healing Touch, Reflection and Bloom, Swiftmend at 25 and Nature's Swiftness at 30 for an emergency instant heal or Entangling Roots. Improved Regrowth at 35 and Wild Growth at 40 add burst and group healing. Cast lower ranks to save mana, keep Rejuvenation on yourself and your target, and root melee; Furor and Natural Shapeshifter fill the end."] = "用於PvP的恢復治療（恢復46 / 野性戰鬥5）。先點自然集中，讓傷害不會打斷你的施法，然後強化治療之觸縮短治療之觸的施法時間，接著反射和綻放，25級點迅癒，30級點自然迅捷，用於緊急瞬發治療或糾纏根鬚。35級的強化癒合和40級的野性痊癒增加爆發和群體治療。施放低等級法術以節省法力，在自己和你的目標身上保持回春術，並定住近戰；激怒和自然變身填補最後的點數。"
L["Purifying Power"] = "淨化能量"
L["Pursuit of Justice"] = "正義追擊"
L["PvP weights at every level: Stamina, armor and burst count for more, and hit stops at the player-vs-player caps."] = "每個等級都使用PvP權重：耐力、護甲和爆發的權重更高，命中在玩家對玩家的上限時停止累積。"
