L["Fire for questing alone, single target only: Fireball and Pyroblast, one or two mobs at a time, no AoE pulls. To pull packs, Frost: AoE Leveling is the fastest Mage build, about twice as fast in our model. Improved Fire Blast and Incineration first, Ignite at 15-19, Pyroblast at 20, Improved Flamestrike, Burning Soul and Heating Up by 25, then Frost from 26 (Elemental Precision, Improved Frostbolt, Improved Frost Nova, Ice Shards, Ice Lance at 36, Shatter), Master of Elements in the 40s, Improved Scorch, Critical Mass at 48-52, Fire Power and Combustion at 58."] = "單人解任務的火焰配置，只打單體：火球術和炎爆術，一次一兩隻怪，不拉群範圍。想拉一群怪的話，冰霜：範圍練功是最快的法師配置，在我們的模型中約快一倍。先點強化火焰衝擊和焚化，15-19級點點燃，20級點炎爆術，25級前點強化烈焰風暴、燃燒之魂和提高熱量，然後26級起點冰霜系（元素準確、強化寒冰箭、強化冰霜新星、寒冰碎片、36級的冰霜長矛、碎冰），40多級點元素大師，接著強化灼燒，48-52級點火焰重擊，再點火焰強化，58級點燃燒。"
