L["Discipline: PvP Leveling"] = "戒律：PvP練功"
L["Arms with a two-hander for open-world PvP while leveling (36 Arms / 14 Protection / 1 Fury). Improved Rend, Deflection, Improved Overpower, Improved Heroic Strike and Deep Wounds by 22, then Two-Handed Weapon Specialization at 25-27, Impale and Bloodthrill to 34, Improved Slam, Improved Hamstring for sticking to targets, Sweeping Strikes at 39 and Mortal Strike at 40 to cut their healing. Weaponmaster starts at 41, then Protection to stay alive: Iron Will, Anticipation and Last Stand, then the rest of Weaponmaster, Improved Disarm and Cruelty last at 60."] = "練功期間用於開放世界PvP的雙手武器武器系配置（武器36 / 防護14 / 狂怒1）。22級前點強化撕裂、偏斜、強化壓制、強化英勇打擊和重傷，然後25-27級點雙手武器專精，34級前點穿刺和鮮血快感，接著強化猛擊、強化斷筋用來黏住目標，39級點橫掃攻擊，40級點致死打擊以削減對方的治療。41級開始點武器大師，然後點防護系保命：鋼鐵意志、預知和破釜沉舟，接著武器大師的剩餘點數、強化繳械，60級最後點殘忍。"
L["Dual-wield Fury for open-world PvP while leveling, with two one-handers. Charge or Intercept in, Hamstring, Bloodthirst on cooldown from 40, Piercing Howl on runners. Cruelty first, Unbridled Wrath at 15-19, Piercing Howl at 20, Furious Precision for off-hand hit, Dual Wield Specialization from 25, Death Wish at 30, Flurry from 35, Bloodthirst at 40, Raging Blows for a cheaper Whirlwind, Enrage in the 40s, then Improved Intercept at 49 to close gaps, Improved Berserker Rage at 50 for a chance to break slows, Lingering Rage and Improved Bloodrage."] = "練功期間用於開放世界PvP的雙持狂怒配置，使用兩把單手武器。用衝鋒或攔截切入，斷筋，40級起冷卻好就用嗜血，對逃跑的人用刺耳怒吼。先點殘忍，15-19級點怒不可遏，20級點刺耳怒吼，接著狂暴精確提高副手命中，25級起點雙武器專精，30級點死亡之願，35級起點亂舞，40級點嗜血，狂怒之擊讓旋風斬更便宜，40多級點狂怒，然後49級點強化攔截來拉近距離，50級點強化狂暴之怒取得擺脫減速的機會，接著Lingering Rage和強化血性狂暴。"
L["Shield Protection for open-world PvP while leveling, with a sword and shield, for players who want to be hard to kill rather than kill fast. Shield Specialization and Improved Revenge first, Anticipation, Last Stand at 20, Master of Defense, Improved Shield Bash at 25-26 to silence casters, Improved Disarm, Concussion Blow at 30 for a stun, then Focused Rage, Improved Shield Wall, Bastion, then Shield Slam at 40. After that Improved Rend and the Fury tree: Booming Voice, Cruelty, Unbridled Wrath, Piercing Howl at 52 for a slow, Blood Craze, Lingering Rage and Furious Precision."] = "練功期間用於開放世界PvP的盾牌防護配置，使用劍和盾，適合想要難以被殺而非快速擊殺的玩家。先點盾牌專精和強化復仇，接著預知，20級點破釜沉舟，接著防禦大師，25-26級點強化盾擊來沉默施法者，接著強化繳械，30級點震盪猛擊取得擊昏，然後集中怒氣、強化盾牆、堡壘，然後40級點盾牌猛擊。之後點強化撕裂和狂怒系：震耳嗓音、殘忍、怒不可遏，52級點刺耳怒吼取得減速，接著血之狂熱、Lingering Rage和Furious Precision。"
L["A two-hander Retribution build for open-world PvP while leveling, with a Holy dip for self-healing. Deflection first, Improved Judgement, Benediction and Seal of Command at 20 (its Judgement hits twice as hard on a target in Hammer of Justice), Pursuit of Justice and Sanctified Judgement, Eye for an Eye, Repentance at 30 for a free heal or a reset, then Divine Intellect, Spiritual Focus and Healing Light so your Holy Lights land, Voice of Truth at 41, Unyielding Faith, Divine Favor and Reverence. Experimental and model-based: a duel simulation against each class, not a combat log."] = "練功期間用於野外 PvP 的雙手武器懲戒配置，並投資少量神聖以自我治療。先點 偏斜，接著是 強化審判、祈福，20 級點 命令聖印（它的 審判 對受到 制裁之錘 影響的目標造成兩倍傷害）、正義追擊 與 聖化審判、以眼還眼，30 級點 懺悔 取得免費治療或重置，接著是讓你的 聖光術 順利施放的 神聖智慧、精神集中 與 治療之光，41 級點 真理之聲，再來是 不滅信仰、神恩術 與 崇敬。實驗性且以模型為基礎：是針對每個職業的決鬥模擬，不是戰鬥記錄。"
L["A Holy build for open-world PvP while leveling (27 Holy / 24 Retribution): you win the long fights on mana and heals. Divine Intellect, Spiritual Focus and Healing Light first, Reverence at 20-22, Voice of Truth, Improved Seals and Divine Favor by 25, then Benediction to 31 and Retribution for damage: Improved Judgement, Holy Conduit, Conviction, Seal of Command at 37, Pursuit of Justice, Unyielding Faith and Sanctified Judgement by 42, Eye for an Eye, then Holy Shock at 48, Vengeance, Repentance, Illumination and Holy Power late. Experimental and model-based: a duel simulation against each class, not a combat log."] = "練功期間用於野外 PvP 的神聖配置（神聖 27 / 懲戒 24）：靠法力與治療贏得長時間的戰鬥。先點 神聖智慧、精神集中 與 治療之光，20 至 22 級點 崇敬，25 級前點 真理之聲、強化聖印 與 神恩術，接著點 祈福 到 31 級，再點懲戒取得傷害：強化審判、神聖導體、定罪、37 級的 命令聖印、42 級前的 正義追擊、不滅信仰 與 聖化審判、以眼還眼，然後 48 級點 神聖震擊，後期再點 復仇、懺悔、啟發 與 聖能。實驗性且以模型為基礎：是針對每個職業的決鬥模擬，不是戰鬥記錄。"
L["Sword and board for open-world PvP while leveling: hard to kill, with stuns. Redoubt and Precision first, Guardian's Favor by 19 for a longer Blessing of Freedom and a shorter Blessing of Protection cooldown, Improved Righteous Fury and Sacred Duty, One-Handed Weapon Specialization, Improved Hammer of Justice and Templar's Bulwark at 30 (the biggest single gain), Shield Specialization, Iron Creed and Holy Shield at 40, then Deflection and Reckoning. Experimental and model-based: a duel simulation against each class, not a combat log; Protection is the weakest Paladin duel tree."] = "練功期間用於野外 PvP 的劍盾配置：難以擊殺，並帶有昏迷效果。先點 盾牌壁壘 與 精確，19 級前點 守護者的寵愛 以延長 自由祝福 並縮短 保護祝福 冷卻時間，接著是 強化正義之怒 與 神聖職務、單手武器專精，30 級點 強化裁決之錘 與 聖殿騎士之壁壘（單點收益最大），40 級點 盾牌專精、鐵之教條 與 神聖之盾，最後是 偏斜 與 清算。實驗性且以模型為基礎：是針對每個職業的決鬥模擬，不是戰鬥記錄；防護是聖騎士決鬥表現最弱的天賦樹。"
L["Shadow for open-world PvP while leveling (35 Shadow / 13 Holy / 3 Discipline): Shadow Word: Pain, Devouring Plague and Mind Blast, then Mind Flay, with Blackout stuns, Psychic Scream, Silence and Vampiric Embrace healing you. Blackout at 10-15, Twilight Focus (a chance to ignore pushback), Improved Shadow Word: Pain, Shadow Focus, Improved Mind Blast, Mind Flay at 24, Shadow Weaving, Vampiric Embrace at 30, Devouring Contagion, Silence at 34, Darkness at 36-40, Shadowform at 41, then Holy: Spell Warding at 49-53 and Blessed Recovery. Improved Renew is only there to unlock Spell Warding."] = "練功期間用於開放世界PvP的暗影配置（暗影35 / 神聖13 / 戒律3）：暗言術：痛、噬靈瘟疫和心靈震爆，然後精神鞭笞，搭配昏厥的昏迷、心靈尖嘯、沉默，以及治療你的吸血鬼的擁抱。10-15級點昏厥，接著暮光集中（有機率無視施法推遲）、強化暗言術：痛、暗影集中、強化心靈震爆，24級點精神鞭笞，接著暗影之波，30級點吸血鬼的擁抱，接著吞噬疫病，34級點沉默，36-40級點黑暗，41級點暗影形態，然後點神聖系：49-53級點法術護衛，接著祝福復元。強化恢復只是為了開啟法術護衛。"
L["Discipline for open-world PvP while leveling (34 Discipline / 17 Holy): you win by damage (Smite, Mind Blast and damage over time spells), with Power Word: Shield, Flash Heal and Penance when you drop low. Wand Specialization, Twin Disciplines, Mental Strength and Meditation to 22, Improved Power Word: Shield, Soul Warding at 26, Mental Agility and Improved Inner Fire in the 20s, Penance at 30, Silent Resolve, Holy Specialization, Renewed Hope at 40, Power Infusion at 42, then Spell Warding, Divine Fury from 47 for a faster Smite, Divine Aegis from 52 and Improved Healing last."] = "練功期間用於開放世界PvP的戒律配置（戒律34 / 神聖17）：你靠傷害取勝（懲擊、心靈震爆和持續傷害法術），血量變低時用真言術：盾、快速治療和懺悟。22級前點魔杖專精、雙生戒律、心靈之力和冥想，接著強化真言術：盾，26級點靈魂結界，20多級點精神敏銳和強化心靈之火，30級點懺悟，接著無聲消退、神聖專精，40級點嶄新希望，42級點注入能量，然後法術護衛，47級起點神聖之怒讓懲擊更快，52級起點神禦之盾，最後點強化治療術。"
L["Holy for open-world PvP while leveling (27 Holy / 23 Discipline / 1 Shadow): Smite and your damage over time spells, Flash Heal when you drop low, and talents that keep your casts going and mana up. Twilight Focus and Wand Specialization first, Holy Specialization, Spell Warding and Divine Fury (a faster Smite) by 23, Twin Disciplines, Blessed Recovery and Improved Healing in the 20s, Mental Strength at 31-35, then Meditation, Improved Power Word: Shield, Mental Agility and Improved Inner Fire, Spiritual Guidance from 49, Soul Warding at 50, then Litany of Light and Spiritual Healing. Blackout is filler."] = "練功期間用於開放世界PvP的神聖配置（神聖27 / 戒律23 / 暗影1）：懲擊和持續傷害法術，血量變低時用快速治療，加上讓施法不中斷、法力充足的天賦。先點暮光集中和魔杖專精，23級前點神聖專精、法術護衛和神聖之怒（懲擊更快），20多級點雙生戒律、祝福復元和強化治療術，31-35級點心靈之力，然後冥想、強化真言術：盾、精神敏銳和強化心靈之火，49級起點精神導引，50級點靈魂結界，然後聖光連禱和精神治療。昏厥是填充點數。"
L["Balance: PvP Leveling"] = "平衡：PvP練功"
L["Feral: PvP Leveling"] = "野性戰鬥：PvP練功"
L["Restoration: PvP Leveling"] = "恢復：PvP練功"
L["Enhancement: PvP Leveling"] = "增強：PvP練功"
L["Elemental: PvP Leveling"] = "元素：PvP練功"
L["Affliction: PvP Leveling"] = "痛苦：PvP練功"
L["Demonology: PvP Leveling"] = "惡魔學識：PvP練功"
L["Destruction: PvP Leveling"] = "毀滅：PvP練功"
L["Balance caster for open-world PvP while leveling (Balance 37 / Restoration 14). Genesis first, Moonglow and Nature's Majesty in the teens, Nature's Splendor at 20 for a longer Moonfire, Improved Entangling Roots from 21 so roots hold longer on melee, Insect Swarm at 25 and Improved Starfire from 26 for its stun, with Nature's Focus mixed in so damage doesn't push back your casts. Then Naturalist at 37-41, Bloom at 42, Improved Moonfire, Vengeance, Moonfury at 46-50, Moonkin Form at 51 and Eclipse. Root melee, keep Moonfire and Insect Swarm up, cast Starfire, and leave Moonkin Form to heal yourself when you drop low."] = "練功期間用於開放世界PvP的平衡施法配置（平衡37 / 恢復14）。先點起源，10多級點月光和自然威嚴，20級點自然光采讓月火術持續更久，21級起點強化糾纏根鬚讓根鬚對近戰定得更久，25級點蟲群，26級起點強化星火術取得擊昏，期間穿插自然集中讓傷害不會延遲你的施法。然後37-41級點強化治療之觸，42級點綻放，接著強化月火術、復仇，46-50級點月怒，51級點梟獸形態，接著蝕星蔽月。定身近戰，保持月火術和蟲群，施放星火術，血量變低時離開梟獸形態治療自己。"
L["Feral for open-world PvP while leveling, played in Bear Form (Feral 26 / Restoration 25). Ferocity and Heart of the Wild first, Furor, Brutal Impact at 19 for a longer, more frequent Bash, Natural Shapeshifter for cheaper shifting, Feral Swiftness, Thick Hide at 26 and Feral Charge at 27, then Naturalist and Bloom. Sharpened Claws, Savage Fury and Predatory Strikes in the 30s, Nature's Focus so your heals aren't pushed back, Leader of the Pack at 44 and Natural Instinct. Then Restoration for self-healing (Gift of Nature, Tranquil Spirit, Nature's Swiftness at 52, Living Spirit). Charge and Bash, Maul, and shift out to heal when you drop low."] = "練功期間用於開放世界PvP的野性戰鬥配置，以熊形態進行（野性戰鬥26 / 恢復25）。先點兇暴和野性之心，接著激怒，19級點野蠻衝撞讓重擊持續更久、更常可用，接著自然變身讓變身更省法力、野性迅捷，26級點厚皮，27級點野性衝鋒，然後強化治療之觸和綻放。30多級點鋒利獸爪、野蠻暴怒和猛獸攻擊，接著自然集中讓你的治療不被延遲，44級點獸群領袖，接著Natural Instinct。然後點恢復系提供自我治療（自然賜福、寧靜之魂，52級點自然迅捷，接著活化精神）。衝鋒接重擊，用槌擊，血量變低時變回人形治療。"
L["Restoration for open-world PvP while leveling (Restoration 27 / Balance 24). Nature's Focus first so your casts aren't pushed back, Reflection at 15-17, Naturalist from 18, Bloom at 20 so an expiring Rejuvenation heals you again, Gift of Nature in the 20s, Tranquil Spirit, then Nature's Swiftness at 30. The 30s and 40s go to Balance: Genesis at 31-35, Improved Moonfire, Nature's Majesty, Nature's Reach, Improved Entangling Roots, Nature's Splendor, Insect Swarm at 46 and Improved Starfire at 47-51, then Living Spirit, Moonglow, then Swiftmend at 58. Root melee, keep Moonfire and Insect Swarm up, cast Starfire or Wrath, and heal when you drop low."] = "練功期間用於開放世界PvP的恢復配置（恢復27 / 平衡24）。先點自然集中讓你的施法不被延遲，15-17級點反射，18級起點強化治療之觸，20級點綻放，讓到期的回春術再治療你一次，20多級點自然賜福，接著寧靜之魂，然後30級點自然迅捷。30多級和40多級點平衡系：31-35級點起源，接著強化月火術、自然威嚴、自然延伸、強化糾纏根鬚、自然光采，46級點蟲群，47-51級點強化星火術，然後活化精神、月光，接著58級點迅癒。定身近戰，保持月火術和蟲群，施放星火術或憤怒，血量變低時治療自己。"
L["Enhancement with a two-hander for open-world PvP while leveling: Rockbiter (Windfury from 30 if it hits harder), Flame Shock and Earth Shock (the interrupt), Stormstrike from 25, Lightning Shield, Stoneskin and Grounding Totems, and Healing Wave when you drop low. Ancestral Knowledge first for mana, Improved Lightning Shield, Guardian Totems, Shamanistic Focus, Mental Dexterity, Thundering Strikes, Toughness, Mental Quickness, Spirit Weapons (parry), Improved Stormstrike, Anticipation, then Rage of the Farseer at 40. Then Restoration: Tidal Focus, Mindfulness, Improved Reincarnation, Totemic Focus for cheaper totems, Healing Focus, then Mana Tide Totem at 56, with Elemental Weapons as the last point."] = "練功期間用於開放世界PvP、使用雙手武器的增強配置：石化武器（30級起若風怒武器打得更重就改用它）、烈焰震擊和大地震擊（打斷技），25級起用風暴打擊，閃電之盾、石甲圖騰和根基圖騰，血量變低時用治療波。先點先祖知識增加法力，接著強化閃電之盾、守護圖騰、薩滿之凝、心靈迅敏、雷鳴猛擊、堅韌、思想迅捷、魂化武器（招架）、強化風暴打擊、預知，然後40級點先知之怒。之後點恢復系：潮汐集中、正念、強化復生、圖騰集中讓圖騰更省法力、專注治療，然後56級點法力之潮圖騰，最後一點給元素武器。"
L["Elemental for open-world PvP while leveling: Flame Shock, then Lava Burst and Lightning Bolt at range, Earth Shock to interrupt, Earthbind and Frost Shock to keep melee off you, Healing Wave when you're losing the race. Convection first, Reverberation, Call of Flame, Elemental Focus at 20, Elemental Warding, Earthbound at 25 (Earthbind roots), Eye of the Storm against pushback, Concussion, Lava Burst at 30 and Elemental Reach. From 32, Restoration: Tidal Focus, Improved Healing Wave, Improved Reincarnation, Mindfulness, Healing Focus, Mana Tide Totem at 47, Restorative Totems for a stronger Healing Stream Totem, Nature's Swiftness at 52 and Healing Way, with the rest of Concussion late."] = "練功期間用於開放世界PvP的元素配置：先上烈焰震擊，然後在遠距離用熔岩爆發和閃電箭，用大地震擊打斷，用地縛術和冰霜震擊讓近戰無法接近，在拼血快要輸時用治療波。先點傳導，接著迴響、烈焰召喚，20級點元素集中，接著元素結界，25級點大地之縛（地縛術可定身），接著暴風之眼對抗施法延遲、震盪，30級點熔岩爆發，接著元素延伸。32級起點恢復系：潮汐集中、強化治療波、強化復生、正念、專注治療，47級點法力之潮圖騰，接著恢復圖騰讓治療之泉圖騰更強，52級點自然迅捷，接著治療之路，後期再點滿震盪。"
L["Restoration for open-world PvP while leveling: you outlast the opponent, healing yourself with Healing Wave, Healing Stream Totem and Nature's Swiftness while Flame Shock, Earth Shock, Lightning Bolt and Lightning Shield do the damage. Improved Healing Wave first, Tidal Focus and Mindfulness, Improved Reincarnation, Healing Focus at 20, Mana Tide Totem at 25, Restorative Totems, Nature's Swiftness at 30 and Healing Way. Then Elemental for damage: Convection at 34-38, Call of Flame, Reverberation, Elemental Focus, Elemental Warding, then Earthbound at 49, and back to Restoration with Ancestral Healing, Purification at 51-55 and Riptide at 56."] = "練功期間用於開放世界PvP的恢復配置：你靠續航力撐贏對手，用治療波、治療之泉圖騰和自然迅捷治療自己，同時由烈焰震擊、大地震擊、閃電箭和閃電之盾造成傷害。先點強化治療波，接著潮汐集中和正念、強化復生，20級點專注治療，25級點法力之潮圖騰，接著恢復圖騰，30級點自然迅捷，接著治療之路。然後點元素系增加傷害：34-38級點傳導，接著烈焰召喚、迴響、元素集中、元素結界，然後49級點大地之縛，再回到恢復系點先祖治療，51-55級點淨化，56級點激流。"
L["Affliction for open-world PvP while leveling, with the Succubus out. Improved Corruption at 10, Suppression, and Improved Drains at 15-17 for Drain Life, your filler that heals you for what it deals. Grim Reach at 18 lets you start from further away, then Pandemic at 20, Fel Concentration so damage doesn't interrupt your drains, Amplify Curse, Improved Bane of Agony, then Curse of Exhaustion at 25 to slow melee chasing you, Nightfall, Malevolence, Siphon Life at 30, Soul Siphon at 31-33 and Shadow Mastery at 35-39. The 40s and 50s go to Destruction: Destructive Reach, Improved Shadow Bolt, Molten Skin at 46-50 for less damage taken, Shadowburn at 51 and Ruin. Keep the Succubus out and Seduce a melee attacker."] = "練功期間用於開放世界PvP的痛苦配置，讓魅魔保持在場。10級點強化腐蝕術，接著鎮壓，15-17級點強化吸取以強化吸取生命，它是你的填補技能，造成多少傷害就治療你多少。18級點無情延伸讓你能從更遠處開打，然後20級點災疫，接著惡魔專注讓傷害不會打斷你的吸取，然後詛咒增幅、強化痛苦災厄，接著25級點疲勞詛咒讓追擊你的近戰減速，接著夜幕、惡意，30級點生命虹吸，31-33級點靈魂虹吸，35-39級點暗影專精。40多級和50多級點毀滅系：毀滅延伸、強化暗影箭，46-50級點熔火之膚以減少受到的傷害，51級點暗影灼燒，接著毀滅。讓魅魔保持在場，並對近戰攻擊者使用誘惑。"
L["Deep Demonology for open-world PvP while leveling, with the Succubus out from 20 and Seduction to stop a melee attacker; Drain Life is your filler. Demonic Embrace, Unholy Power and Improved Sayaad come first, then Soul Link at 31, which sends 30% of the damage you take to your pet; take the point in Demonic Sacrifice it needs, but keep the pet out. Demonic Knowledge and Master Demonologist follow, then Demonic Pact at 41: sacrifice the Felhunter (health over time) or the Imp (more Shadow damage), either works, then summon the Succubus again."] = "練功期間用於開放世界PvP的深度惡魔學識配置，20級起帶魅魔出場，用誘惑阻止近戰攻擊者；吸取生命是你的填補技能。先點惡魔之擁、邪惡強化和強化薩亞德，然後31級點靈魂鏈結，它會把你受到的傷害的30%轉給你的寵物；點它需要的那一點惡魔犧牲，但讓寵物留在場上。接著是惡魔知識和惡魔學識大師，然後41級點惡魔契印：犧牲地獄獵犬（持續回復生命力）或小鬼（更多暗影傷害）都可以，然後再次召喚魅魔。"
L["Destruction for open-world PvP while leveling, built for burst, with the Succubus out. Destructive Reach and Bane first, Molten Skin at 15-19 for less damage taken, Shadowburn at 20 as an instant finisher, Aftermath, then Conflagrate at 25 for a second burst. Improved Corruption, Suppression and Improved Drains around 30 make Drain Life your filler between Immolate and Conflagrate, healing you for what it deals. Then Agonizing Flames, Fire and Brimstone, Ruin, Shadow and Flame from 43, and Affliction late: Soul Harvest, Improved Bane of Agony, Pandemic, Nightfall, Malevolence, Siphon Life and Soul Siphon. Keep the Succubus out and Seduce a melee attacker."] = "練功期間用於開放世界PvP的毀滅配置，主打爆發，讓魅魔保持在場。先點毀滅延伸和災禍，15-19級點熔火之膚以減少受到的傷害，20級點暗影灼燒作為瞬發收尾技，接著清算，然後25級點焚燒作為第二波爆發。30級左右點強化腐蝕術、鎮壓和強化吸取，讓吸取生命成為獻祭與焚燒之間的填補技能，造成多少傷害就治療你多少。然後是苦惱之焰、硫磺與火焰、毀滅，43級起點暗影與火焰，後期點痛苦系：靈魂收割、強化痛苦災厄、災疫、夜幕、惡意、生命虹吸和靈魂虹吸。讓魅魔保持在場，並對近戰攻擊者使用誘惑。"
L["Arcane: PvP Leveling"] = "秘法：PvP練功"
L["Fire: PvP Leveling"] = "火焰：PvP練功"
L["Frost: PvP Leveling"] = "冰霜：PvP練功"
L["Beast Mastery: PvP Leveling"] = "野獸控制：PvP練功"
L["Marksmanship: PvP Leveling"] = "射擊：PvP練功"
L["Survival: PvP Leveling"] = "生存：PvP練功"
L["Assassination: PvP Leveling"] = "刺殺：PvP練功"
L["Combat: PvP Leveling"] = "戰鬥：PvP練功"
L["Subtlety: PvP Leveling"] = "敏銳：PvP練功"
L["Arcane Blast into Arcane Missiles for open-world PvP while leveling, with Presence of Mind at 32 and Arcane Power at 42 for a burst opener. Improved Channeling first, Arcane Resilience for armor, Arcane Concentration at 20, Arcane Blast at 21, Arcane Impact and Improved Counterspell; the 30s go to Arcane Mind, Arcane Wrath and Arcane Instability. From 43 the points go to Fire: Accelerant for a faster Arcane Wrath, Ignite, Impact for a chance to stun with Fire Blast, Improved Fire Blast and Burning Soul. Open with Presence of Mind and Arcane Power before a melee class reaches you."] = "練功期間用於開放世界PvP的秘法配置，以秘法衝擊接秘法飛彈，32級的氣定神閒和42級的秘法強化提供爆發開場。先點強化引導，秘法轉化提供護甲，20級點秘法專注，21級點秘法衝擊，接著秘法碰撞和強化法術反制；30多級點秘法心智、秘法懲戒和秘法增效。43級起點數給火焰系：Accelerant讓秘法懲戒更快，接著點燃、衝擊讓火焰衝擊有機率使目標昏迷、強化火焰衝擊和燃燒之魂。在近戰職業接近你之前，用氣定神閒和秘法強化開場。"
L["Fireball and Fire Blast for open-world PvP while leveling, opening with Pyroblast and Combustion. Accelerant first for a faster Fireball, Impact and Incineration in the teens, Burning Soul at 20-22 so damage pushes back your casts less often, Pyroblast at 23, Improved Fire Blast, Heating Up, Blast Wave at 31, Critical Mass, Master of Elements and Fire Power, Combustion at 41, then Frost late (Ice Lance at 51, Shatter at 56-58). Open with Pyroblast from range, then Blast Wave and Frost Nova when a melee class reaches you."] = "練功期間用於開放世界PvP的火焰配置，使用火球術和火焰衝擊，以炎爆術和燃燒開場。先點Accelerant讓火球術更快，10多級點衝擊和焚化，20-22級點燃燒之魂讓受到傷害時施法較少被推遲，23級點炎爆術，接著強化火焰衝擊、提高熱量，31級點衝擊波，接著火焰重擊、元素大師和火焰強化，41級點燃燒，然後後期點冰霜系（51級點冰霜長矛，56-58級點碎冰）。從遠距離用炎爆術開場，近戰職業接近時用衝擊波和冰霜新星。"
L["Frostbolt for open-world PvP while leveling: keep the target slowed, Frost Nova or a Frostbite freeze when a melee class reaches you, then step away and Ice Lance or Frostbolt while it is frozen. Improved Frostbolt first, Frostbite and Permafrost in the teens, Ice Lance at 20, Precision, Ice Shards, then Shatter at 25-28, Fingers of Frost at 30, Improved Cone of Cold and Winter's Chill in the 30s, Cold Snap at 39 (a second Frost Nova) and Ice Barrier at 40, then Frost Warding and the Fire tree late: Incineration for more Ice Lance crits, Ignite, Impact and Improved Fire Blast."] = "練功期間用於開放世界PvP的寒冰箭配置：讓目標保持減速，近戰職業接近你時用冰霜新星或霜寒刺骨的冰凍，然後拉開距離，趁目標被凍住時用冰霜長矛或寒冰箭。先點強化寒冰箭，10多級點霜寒刺骨和極寒冰霜，20級點冰霜長矛，接著精確、寒冰碎片，然後25-28級點碎冰，30級點冰霜之指，30多級點強化冰錐術和深冬之寒，39級點急速冷卻（第二次冰霜新星），40級點寒冰護體，然後是冰霜護罩，後期點火焰系：焚化讓冰霜長矛更常致命一擊、點燃、衝擊和強化火焰衝擊。"
L["Beast Mastery shooting for open-world PvP while leveling, with the pet doing a large share of the damage. Deadly Aspects and Hawk Eye (longer range to kite) first, Improved Concussive Shot at 17 for a chance to stun, Improved Aspect of the Monkey from 21, Summon Hawk at 29, Ferocity from 30 and Intimidation at 34 for a stun. Frenzy from 39 and Bestial Wrath at 44, then Survival for staying alive: Deflection, Survivalist from 50 (more health) and Deterrence at 55, with Improved Wing Clip and Clever Traps last."] = "練功期間用於開放世界PvP的野獸控制射擊配置，寵物負責很大一部分傷害。先點致命守護和鷹眼（射程更遠，方便風箏），17級點強化震盪射擊取得昏迷機率，21級起點強化靈猴守護，29級點召喚獵鷹，30級起點兇暴，34級點脅迫取得昏迷。39級起點狂亂，44級點狂野怒火，然後點生存系保命：偏斜，50級起點生存技能專家（更多生命力），55級點威懾，最後是強化摔絆和靈巧陷阱。"
L["Marksmanship shooting for open-world PvP while leveling: kite at long range and slow or stun anyone who closes in. Hawk Eye and Improved Concussive Shot first, Lethal Attacks, Improved Arcane Shot from 21, Rapid Killing, then Trueshot Aura at 27. The 30s and 40s go mostly to Survival: Survivalist at 32, Deterrence at 37 and Improved Wing Clip, with Marksmanship's Improved Stings from 39, then Scatter Shot at 45. At 52 Survivalist's Discipline shortens trap cooldowns. Barrage and a point of Lone Wolf (it helps once your pet is dead) are the last points."] = "練功期間用於開放世界PvP的射擊配置：在遠距離風箏，對靠近的人減速或使其昏迷。先點鷹眼和強化震盪射擊，接著致命攻擊，21級起點強化秘法射擊，接著急速殺戮，然後27級點強擊光環。30多級和40多級主要點生存系：32級點生存技能專家，37級點威懾，接著強化摔絆，39級起點射擊系的強化釘刺，然後45級點驅散射擊。52級的生存專家戒律縮短陷阱冷卻時間。最後的點數是彈幕和一點孤狼（寵物死掉後有幫助）。"
L["Survival as a ranged build for open-world PvP while leveling: you shoot and kite. Improved Tracking and Hawk Eye (longer range) first, Survivalist at 19, Deterrence at 24, Improved Wing Clip at 26, then the rest of Improved Concussive Shot for its stun chance. From 30, mostly Marksmanship: Lethal Attacks, Improved Stings, Rapid Killing, Careful Aim, then Trueshot Aura at 41, with Surefooted from Survival. Entrapment at 46 roots whoever triggers your traps, at 47 Survivalist's Discipline shortens trap and Deterrence cooldowns, and Scatter Shot comes at 52."] = "練功期間用於開放世界PvP的遠程生存配置：你射擊並風箏。先點強化追蹤和鷹眼（射程更遠），19級點生存技能專家，24級點威懾，26級點強化摔絆，然後點完強化震盪射擊取得昏迷機率。30級起主要點射擊系：致命攻擊、強化釘刺、急速殺戮、仔細瞄準，然後41級點強擊光環，再加上生存系的穩固。46級的誘捕會定身觸發你陷阱的人，47級的生存專家戒律縮短陷阱和威懾的冷卻時間，52級點驅散射擊。"
L["Assassination with two swords for open-world PvP while leveling (26 Assassination / 25 Combat). Malice and Improved Sinister Strike first, Murder at 16-17, Lightning Reflexes, then Deflection, Improved Slice and Dice and Precision through the 20s, Relentless Strikes at 29, Riposte at 31, Ruthlessness and Endurance, Lethality at 37 and Cold Blood at 38, Flawless Execution at 41. Then Vile Poisons, Dual Wield Specialization, Improved Poisons, Improved Kidney Shot, Blade Flurry at 51, Vigor, Improved Eviscerate, Seal Fate, then Improved Kick at 59 for a silence. Open with Cheap Shot into Kidney Shot."] = "練功期間用於開放世界PvP的雙劍刺殺配置（刺殺26 / 戰鬥25）。先點惡意和強化邪惡攻擊，16-17級點謀殺，接著閃電反射，然後20多級點偏斜、強化切割和精確，29級點無情打擊，31級點還擊，接著無情和耐久，37級點致命偷襲，38級點冷血，41級點完美處決。然後是惡性毒藥、雙武器專精、強化毒藥、強化腎擊，51級點劍刃亂舞，接著精力、強化剔骨、封印命運，然後59級點強化腳踢取得沉默。以偷襲接腎擊起手。"
L["Combat with two swords for open-world PvP while leveling (32 Combat / 18 Assassination / 1 Subtlety). Improved Sinister Strike first, Lightning Reflexes at 12-14, Deflection, Precision, Endurance and Riposte at 21, Dual Wield Specialization at 26-29, Blade Flurry at 30, Hack and Slash from 31, Flawless Execution, Weapon Expertise, Aggression and Adrenaline Rush at 40. From 41 the points go to Assassination: Malice, Murder, Improved Slice and Dice, Ruthlessness, Relentless Strikes, Lethality and Cold Blood at 56. Open with Cheap Shot into Kidney Shot with Adrenaline Rush and Blade Flurry up."] = "練功期間用於開放世界PvP的雙劍戰鬥配置（戰鬥32 / 刺殺18 / 敏銳1）。先點強化邪惡攻擊，12-14級點閃電反射，接著偏斜、精確、耐久，21級點還擊，26-29級點雙武器專精，30級點劍刃亂舞，31級起點劈斬，然後完美處決、武器專家、侵略，40級點能量刺激。41級起點數給刺殺系：惡意、謀殺、強化切割、無情、無情打擊、致命偷襲，56級點冷血。開啟能量刺激和劍刃亂舞，以偷襲接腎擊起手。"
L["Subtlety with two daggers for open-world PvP while leveling (26 Subtlety / 24 Combat / 1 Assassination). Open with Premeditation and Cheap Shot into Kidney Shot. Master of Deception at 10, Lightning Reflexes, Opportunity, Improved Sinister Strike and Setup, Improved Ambush at 24, Ghostly Strike at 26, Precision, Elusiveness and Riposte in the early 30s, Initiative at 38, Premeditation at 42, Preparation at 44, then Dual Wield Specialization at 47 and Blade Flurry at 51. The last points go to Serrated Blades, Hemorrhage at 55, Dirty Deeds, Hack and Slash and Malice."] = "練功期間用於開放世界PvP的雙匕首敏銳配置（敏銳26 / 戰鬥24 / 刺殺1）。用預謀和偷襲開場，接上腎擊。10級點欺詐大師，接著閃電反射、伺機而動、強化邪惡攻擊和調整，24級點強化伏擊，26級點鬼魅攻擊，30級出頭點精確、飄忽不定和還擊，38級點先發制人，42級點預謀，44級點伺機待發，然後47級點雙武器專精，51級點劍刃亂舞。最後的點數給鋸刃、55級的出血、陰險動作、劈斬和惡意。"
L["Level-60 farming: Balance for the Dire Maul East jump run (Hydrospawn, the Zevrim jump, then Alzzin), Balance 38 / Restoration 13. Fight from range: Entangling Roots on the target, then Wrath and Starfire. Improved Wrath first, Nature's Majesty at 20, Insect Swarm at 25, Eclipse at 30, Moonfury from 35 and Moonkin Form at 40. Then Heart of the Wild, Reflection and Naturalist from Restoration, with Vengeance, Nature's Grace and Improved Entangling Roots in the last points."] = "60級刷怪：用於厄運之槌東區跳躍路線（海多斯博恩、瑟雷姆跳躍，然後是奧茲恩）的平衡配置，平衡38 / 恢復13。在遠程戰鬥：對目標用糾纏根鬚，然後用憤怒和星火術。先點強化憤怒，20級點自然威嚴，25級點蟲群，30級點蝕星蔽月，35級起點月怒，40級點梟獸形態。然後點恢復系的野性之心、反射和強化治療之觸，最後的點數給復仇、自然之賜和強化糾纏根鬚。"
L["Level-60 farming: Balance for the Dire Maul East lasher packs (6 packs of 5), Balance 35 / Restoration 16. Keep the lashers rooted with Entangling Roots and cast Wrath and Starfire from range. Improved Wrath first, Nature's Majesty at 20, Insect Swarm at 25, Eclipse at 30, Moonfury from 35 and Moonkin Form at 40. Then Heart of the Wild, Reflection and Naturalist from Restoration, more Vengeance, and Natural Shapeshifter at 58."] = "60級刷怪：用於厄運之槌東區鞭笞者群（6群、每群5隻）的平衡配置，平衡35 / 恢復16。用糾纏根鬚把鞭笞者定住，在遠程施放憤怒和星火術。先點強化憤怒，20級點自然威嚴，25級點蟲群，30級點蝕星蔽月，35級起點月怒，40級點梟獸形態。然後點恢復系的野性之心、反射和強化治療之觸，再加更多復仇，58級點自然變身。"
L["Level-60 farming with Hurricane: gather packs of mobs and cast Hurricane on them. It levels as Balance: Improved Wrath first, Genesis, Moonglow, Nature's Reach, Improved Moonfire, then Nature's Majesty at 21, Insect Swarm at 25, Improved Starfire from 26, Eclipse at 30, Moonfury from 35 and Moonkin Form at 40. Then Heart of the Wild, Reflection and Naturalist from Restoration, more Vengeance and Genesis, and Bloom at 60."] = "60級使用颶風刷怪：聚集成群的怪，對它們施放颶風。以平衡練功：先點強化憤怒，接著起源、月光、自然延伸、強化月火術，然後21級點自然威嚴，25級點蟲群，26級起點強化星火術，30級點蝕星蔽月，35級起點月怒，40級點梟獸形態。然後點恢復系的野性之心、反射和強化治療之觸，更多復仇和起源，60級點綻放。"
L["Level-60 farming: Balance for the Maraudon Princess run (three elite pairs, then Princess), Balance 38 / Restoration 13. Fight from range: Entangling Roots on the target, then Wrath and Starfire. Improved Wrath first, Moonglow at 15-17, Nature's Majesty at 20, Insect Swarm at 25, Eclipse at 30, Moonfury from 35 and Moonkin Form at 40. Then Heart of the Wild, Reflection and Naturalist from Restoration, with Vengeance, Nature's Grace and Improved Entangling Roots in the last points."] = "60級刷怪：用於瑪拉頓公主路線（三對精英怪，然後是公主）的平衡配置，平衡38 / 恢復13。在遠程戰鬥：對目標用糾纏根鬚，然後用憤怒和星火術。先點強化憤怒，15-17級點月光，20級點自然威嚴，25級點蟲群，30級點蝕星蔽月，35級起點月怒，40級點梟獸形態。然後點恢復系的野性之心、反射和強化治療之觸，最後的點數給復仇、自然之賜和強化糾纏根鬚。"
L["Level-60 farming of the Dire Maul East jump run: Hydrospawn, Zevrim Thornhoof, then Alzzin to half health to open the cave. Beast Mastery (34 / 16 Marksmanship / 1 Survival): your pet holds each mob while you shoot. Bestial Wrath, Frenzy, Ferocity, Unleashed Fury and Intimidation for the pet, with Lethal Attacks, Careful Aim, Efficiency, Rapid Killing and Trueshot Aura from Marksmanship."] = "60級刷厄運之槌東區跳躍路線：海多斯博恩、瑟雷姆·刺蹄，然後把奧茲恩打到半血以打開洞穴。野獸控制（34 / 射擊16 / 生存1）：你的寵物抓住每一隻怪，你負責射擊。寵物方面點狂野怒火、狂亂、兇暴、狂怒釋放和脅迫，再加上射擊系的致命攻擊、仔細瞄準、效率、急速殺戮和強擊光環。"
L["Level-60 farming of the Dire Maul North tribute run: skip the guards with your pet and Feign Death, then kill King Gordok together with Cho'Rush. Beast Mastery (31 / 16 Marksmanship / 4 Survival), shooting while your pet holds the target: Bestial Wrath, Frenzy, Ferocity, Unleashed Fury, Summon Hawk and Intimidation, with Lethal Attacks, Careful Aim, Efficiency and Trueshot Aura from Marksmanship, and Improved Tracking last."] = "60級刷厄運之槌北區貢品路線：用寵物和假死繞過守衛，然後與觀察者克魯什一起擊殺戈多克大王。野獸控制（31 / 射擊16 / 生存4），在寵物抓住目標時射擊：狂野怒火、狂亂、兇暴、狂怒釋放、召喚獵鷹和脅迫，再加上射擊系的致命攻擊、仔細瞄準、效率和強擊光環，最後是強化追蹤。"
L["Level-60 farming of the Maraudon Princess run: three pulls of two elites, then Princess Theradras. Beast Mastery (34 / 16 Marksmanship / 1 Survival): your pet holds each mob while you shoot. Bestial Wrath, Frenzy, Ferocity, Unleashed Fury and Intimidation for the pet, with Lethal Attacks, Careful Aim, Efficiency, Rapid Killing and Trueshot Aura from Marksmanship."] = "60級刷瑪拉頓公主路線：三次各拉兩隻精英怪，然後是瑟萊德絲公主。野獸控制（34 / 射擊16 / 生存1）：你的寵物抓住每一隻怪，你負責射擊。寵物方面點狂野怒火、狂亂、兇暴、狂怒釋放和脅迫，再加上射擊系的致命攻擊、仔細瞄準、效率、急速殺戮和強擊光環。"
L["A level-60 Frost farm for the Dire Maul East jump run past Zevrim Thornhoof to Alzzin, taking the bosses and elites one at a time. Frostbolt is your main spell, with Ice Lance on frozen targets and Fingers of Frost procs (Shatter adds crit against frozen targets). Improved Frostbolt, Precision and Ice Shards first, Ice Lance at 20, Frost Channeling, Shatter and Fingers of Frost, then Incineration from 33 for more Ice Lance crits (Ignite fills the Fire points). Cold Snap at 48, then Ice Barrier at 50 and Winter's Chill at the end."] = "60級冰霜刷怪，用於厄運之槌東區跳躍路線，越過瑟雷姆·刺蹄到奧茲恩，一次對付一個首領或精英怪。寒冰箭是你的主要法術，對冰凍的目標和冰霜之指觸發時用冰霜長矛（碎冰提高對冰凍目標的致命一擊）。先點強化寒冰箭、精確和寒冰碎片，20級點冰霜長矛，接著冰霜導能、碎冰和冰霜之指，然後33級起點焚化讓冰霜長矛更常致命一擊（點燃填補火焰系點數）。48級點急速冷卻，然後50級點寒冰護體，最後是深冬之寒。"
L["A level-60 farm for the Dire Maul East lasher packs (28 Arcane / 23 Frost). Pull a pack, Frost Nova and step away, then Blizzard it down with Cone of Cold between while Improved Blizzard and Permafrost keep it slow. Frost to 32: Improved Frostbolt, Precision, Permafrost, Improved Blizzard at 20, Frost Channeling, Shatter and Improved Cone of Cold. Then Arcane from 33 for mana and burst: Arcane Concentration, Arcane Blast, Missile Barrage, Arcane Meditation, Arcane Mind, Presence of Mind and Arcane Instability."] = "60級刷厄運之槌東區鞭笞者群的配置（秘法28 / 冰霜23）。拉一群怪，冰霜新星後退開，然後用暴風雪清掉，中間穿插冰錐術，強化暴風雪和極寒冰霜讓它們保持減速。冰霜點到32點：強化寒冰箭、精確、極寒冰霜，20級點強化暴風雪，接著冰霜導能、碎冰和強化冰錐術。然後33級起點秘法系取得法力和爆發：秘法專注、秘法衝擊、飛彈彈幕、秘法冥想、秘法心智、氣定神閒和秘法增效。"
L["Two-hander Retribution for leveling through dungeons. Benediction at 10, Deflection, Improved Judgement, Conviction and Seal of Command at 20, Vindication, Sacred Arbiter and Sanctified Judgement in the 20s, Vengeance at 30, Two-Handed Weapon Specialization and Champion of the Light by 37, then Holy: Divine Strength, Improved Seals, Healing Light, Purifying Power, Reverence, Infusion of Light, Illumination and Holy Shock at 58. Judgement of the Crusader on bosses, not trash; Seal of Command, Judgement and Holy Strike on cooldown, Consecration once the tank holds the pack."] = "在地城中練功的雙手武器懲戒配置。10級點祈福，接著偏斜、強化審判、定罪，20級點命令聖印，20多級點辯護、神聖仲裁者和聖化審判，30級點復仇，37級前點雙手武器專精和光之勇士，然後點神聖系：神聖之力、強化聖印、治療之光、淨化能量、崇敬、聖光灌注、啟發，58級點神聖震擊。首領用十字軍審判，小怪不用；冷卻好就用命令聖印、審判和神聖打擊，坦克穩住整群怪後用奉獻。"
L["Holy for questing alone while staying ready to heal a group, about 11% slower than the fastest Paladin solo build. Divine Strength and Improved Seals first, Deflection to 21, then Benediction, Improved Judgement, Conviction, Healing Light, Reverence and Holy Conduit, Seal of Command at 31, Sanctified Judgement, Divine Intellect and Illumination by 45, Holy Shock at 46, then Benediction and Vengeance in the 50s. Play it like Retribution: Judgement of the Crusader to open, then Seal of Command; from 30 pull two mobs and add Consecration, and Holy Shock once you have it."] = "單人解任務的神聖配置，同時隨時能為隊伍治療，比最快的聖騎士單人配置慢約11%。先點神聖之力和強化聖印，21級前點偏斜，然後是祈福、強化審判、定罪、治療之光、崇敬和神聖導體，31級點命令聖印，45級前點聖化審判、神聖智慧和啟發，46級點神聖震擊，然後50多級點祈福和復仇。玩法和懲戒一樣：以十字軍審判開場，然後上命令聖印；30級起一次拉兩隻怪並加上奉獻，有了神聖震擊後也使用它。"
L["Level-60 AoE farming with a one-hander and shield: gather 10-15 normal mobs, drop Consecration, keep Holy Shield up and let Retribution Aura do much of the killing. Holy first for Divine Strength, Improved Seals, Reverence and Holy Conduit (cheaper Consecration), Benediction, then Redoubt from 27, Precision, Templar's Bulwark, Improved Righteous Fury, Holy Shield and Reckoning, with Consecrated Ground near the end. Spell power is your best stat."] = "60級使用單手武器和盾牌的範圍刷怪：聚集10-15隻普通怪，放下奉獻，保持神聖之盾，讓懲戒光環負責大部分擊殺。先點神聖系的神聖之力、強化聖印、崇敬和神聖導體（奉獻更省法力）、祈福，然後27級起點盾牌壁壘，接著精確、聖殿騎士之壁壘、強化正義之怒、神聖之盾和清算，神聖之地在接近最後時取得。法術能量是你最好的屬性。"
L["Level-60 farming with a two-hander: the Dire Maul East jump run (Hydrospawn, Zevrim Thornhoof, then Alzzin to open the cave). Swing with Seal of Command, Judgement and Holy Strike on cooldown, Consecration on packs. Seal of Command at 20, Sacred Arbiter at 25, Vengeance at 30, Champion of the Light from 35, then Unsealed Wrath at 40: swing with Seal of Command, then switch seals to release the stored procs. Holy from 41: Divine Strength, Reverence, Improved Seals and Holy Conduit, with Vindication, then Healing Light last."] = "60級使用雙手武器刷怪：厄運之槌東區跳躍路線（海多斯博恩、瑟雷姆·刺蹄，然後是奧茲恩以打開洞穴）。用命令聖印揮砍，冷卻好就用審判和神聖打擊，成群的怪用奉獻。20級點命令聖印，25級點神聖仲裁者，30級點復仇，35級起點光之勇士，然後40級點Unsealed Wrath：用命令聖印揮砍，然後切換聖印來釋放儲存的觸發效果。41級起點神聖系：神聖之力、崇敬、強化聖印和神聖導體，再加上辯護，最後點治療之光。"
L["Level-60 farming of the Dire Maul East lasher packs (6 packs of 5) with a two-hander: pull a whole pack, Consecration, then swing with Seal of Command, Judgement and Holy Strike on cooldown. Seal of Command at 20, Sacred Arbiter at 25, Two-Handed Weapon Specialization, Vengeance at 30, Champion of the Light from 35, then Unsealed Wrath at 40: swing with Seal of Command, then switch seals to release the stored procs. Holy from 41: Divine Strength, Reverence, Improved Seals and Healing Light, with Vindication last."] = "60級使用雙手武器刷厄運之槌東區鞭笞者群（6群、每群5隻）：拉整群怪，放奉獻，然後用命令聖印揮砍，冷卻好就用審判和神聖打擊。20級點命令聖印，25級點神聖仲裁者，接著雙手武器專精，30級點復仇，35級起點光之勇士，然後40級點Unsealed Wrath：用命令聖印揮砍，然後切換聖印來釋放儲存的觸發效果。41級起點神聖系：神聖之力、崇敬、強化聖印和治療之光，最後點辯護。"
L["Retribution for open-world PvP while leveling, with a Holy dip for self-healing and staying power. Benediction first, Conviction and Sanctified Judgement in the teens, Seal of Command at 20 (its Judgement hits twice as hard on a target in Hammer of Justice), Pursuit of Justice, then Holy through the 20s and 30s: Spiritual Focus, Reverence, Healing Light, Holy Conduit, then Divine Favor at 35. Then Improved Judgement, Eye for an Eye, Improved Seals, Oath of Light, Sacred Arbiter, Unyielding Faith, Repentance at 46, Vengeance from 47, Champion of the Light at 51-55, Unsealed Wrath at 56 and Divine Intellect last. Open with Hammer of Justice and a Judgement, heal behind Divine Protection or Divine Shield. Model-based."] = "練功期間用於開放世界PvP的懲戒配置，點一些神聖系天賦提供自我治療和續航力。先點祈福，10多級點定罪和聖化審判，20級點命令聖印（目標處於制裁之錘效果下時，它的審判傷害加倍），接著正義追擊，然後20多級和30多級點神聖系：精神集中、崇敬、治療之光、神聖導體，然後35級點神恩術。之後是強化審判、以眼還眼、強化聖印、Oath of Light、神聖仲裁者、不滅信仰，46級點懺悔，47級起點復仇，51-55級點光之勇士，56級點Unsealed Wrath，最後點神聖智慧。以制裁之錘和審判起手，在聖佑術或聖盾術保護下治療。依據模型推算。"
L["A Holy build for open-world PvP while leveling: you win the long fights on mana and heals. Spiritual Focus first so your heals go through when you're hit, Reverence and Healing Light in the teens, Holy Conduit at 20, Divine Favor at 22, Improved Seals, Oath of Light at 25 and Benediction to 30, then Retribution for damage (Sanctified Judgement, Improved Judgement, Seal of Command at 36, Pursuit of Justice, Conviction), Divine Precision, Illumination from 42, Eye for an Eye, Sacred Arbiter, Unyielding Faith, Repentance at 51 and Vengeance in the 50s. Stun with Hammer of Justice and keep Divine Shield for the moment you'd lose. Model-based."] = "練功期間用於開放世界PvP的神聖配置：你靠法力和治療贏下持久戰。先點精神集中，讓你被攻擊時治療也能施放完成，10多級點崇敬和治療之光，20級點神聖導體，22級點神恩術，接著強化聖印，25級點Oath of Light，祈福點到30級，然後點懲戒系增加傷害（聖化審判、強化審判、36級點命令聖印、正義追擊、定罪），接著神性精準，42級起點啟發，然後以眼還眼、神聖仲裁者、不滅信仰，51級點懺悔，50多級點復仇。用制裁之錘擊昏，並把聖盾術留到快要輸的時候。依據模型推算。"
L["Sword and board for open-world PvP while leveling: hard to kill, with frequent stuns. Redoubt first for more blocks, Guardian's Favor by 17 for a longer Blessing of Freedom and a shorter Blessing of Protection cooldown, Templar's Bulwark at 20 for a big absorb shield, Improved Hammer of Justice for more stuns, Holy Shield at 30, Reckoning, Iron Creed, then Shieldsworn at 40. Then Retribution: Benediction, Conviction, Improved Judgement and Pursuit of Justice, with Unyielding Faith, Sacred Arbiter, Eye for an Eye and a point of Spiritual Focus last. Model-based."] = "練功期間用於開放世界PvP的劍盾配置：很難被殺死，而且常有昏迷效果。先點盾牌壁壘增加格擋，17級前點守護者的寵愛，讓自由祝福持續更久、保護祝福冷卻更短，20級點聖殿騎士之壁壘取得強力吸收護盾，強化裁決之錘提供更多昏迷，30級點神聖之盾，接著清算、鐵之教條，然後40級點Shieldsworn。之後點懲戒系：祈福、定罪、強化審判和正義追擊，最後點不滅信仰、神聖仲裁者、以眼還眼和一點精神集中。依據模型推算。"
L["A level-60 Shadow farm for the Dire Maul East jump run past Zevrim Thornhoof to Alzzin, taking the bosses and elites one at a time. Power Word: Shield yourself, then Shadow Word: Pain, Devouring Plague and Mind Blast with Mind Flay between; Vampiric Embrace and Devouring Plague heal you. Spirit Tap first, Improved Mind Blast at 15-19, Mind Flay at 20, Shadow Weaving, Dark Inspiration, Vampiric Embrace at 34, Darkness from 35 and Shadowform at 40. Then Twin Disciplines, Mental Strength, Meditation and Mental Agility from Discipline."] = "60級暗影刷怪，用於厄運之槌東區跳躍路線，越過瑟雷姆·刺蹄到奧茲恩，一次對付一個首領或精英怪。給自己上真言術：盾，然後用暗言術：痛、噬靈瘟疫和心靈震爆，中間用精神鞭笞；吸血鬼的擁抱和噬靈瘟疫會治療你。先點精神分流，15-19級點強化心靈震爆，20級點精神鞭笞，接著暗影之波、Dark Inspiration，34級點吸血鬼的擁抱，35級起點黑暗，40級點暗影形態。然後點戒律系的雙生戒律、心靈之力、冥想和精神敏銳。"
L["A level-60 Shadow farm for the Maraudon Princess run: three pairs of elites, then Princess Theradras. Shadow Word: Pain on both elites of a pair, Mind Blast, then Mind Flay; Power Word: Shield yourself and let Blackout stuns and Vampiric Embrace buy time. Spirit Tap first and Blackout early for its stuns, Improved Mind Blast at 15-19, Mind Flay at 20, Shadow Weaving, Vampiric Embrace at 29, Devouring Contagion, Darkness from 35 and Shadowform at 40. Then Twin Disciplines, Mental Strength, Meditation and Mental Agility from Discipline, with Improved Power Word: Shield and Soul Warding last."] = "60級暗影刷怪，用於瑪拉頓公主路線：三對精英怪，然後是瑟萊德絲公主。對每一對的兩隻精英怪都上暗言術：痛，接著心靈震爆，然後精神鞭笞；給自己上真言術：盾，讓昏厥的昏迷效果和吸血鬼的擁抱幫你爭取時間。先點精神分流，並提早點昏厥取得昏迷效果，15-19級點強化心靈震爆，20級點精神鞭笞，接著暗影之波，29級點吸血鬼的擁抱，接著吞噬疫病，35級起點黑暗，40級點暗影形態。然後點戒律系的雙生戒律、心靈之力、冥想和精神敏銳，最後是強化真言術：盾和靈魂結界。"
L["Healing groups through dungeons while leveling: Healing Wave on the tank (lower ranks for small hits), Healing Stream Totem down, Riptide on cooldown from 40 and Chain Heal when the group is hurt, Mana Tide Totem when you run low. Tidal Focus, Mindfulness and Improved Healing Wave first, Water Shield at 20, Mana Tide Totem at 25, then Tidal Mastery and Healing Way through the late 20s. Restorative Totems (stronger Healing Stream and Mana Spring) starts at 34, Purification fills 35-39 and Riptide comes at 40. Ancestral Knowledge at 45-49 and Nature's Swiftness at 54 follow."] = "練功期間在地城治療隊伍：對坦克用治療波（小傷害用低等級），放下治療之泉圖騰，40級起冷卻好就用激流，隊伍受傷時用治療鍊，法力不足時用法力之潮圖騰。先點潮汐集中、正念和強化治療波，20級點水之盾，25級點法力之潮圖騰，然後在20多級後段點潮汐專精和治療之路。恢復圖騰（更強的治療之泉和法力之泉）從34級開始，淨化填補35-39級，激流在40級取得。接著45-49級點先祖知識，54級點自然迅捷。"
L["Elemental for dungeons while leveling: Fire Nova and Magma Totem on packs once the tank has them, Flame Shock, Earth Shock and Lightning Bolt on bosses. Convection, Call of Flame, Elemental Alacrity and Elemental Focus first, then Tidal Focus and Mindfulness from Restoration for mana, Concussion at 30-32 and Trial by Fire at 33-34. Reverberation at 37, Lightning Overload at 38-40 and Call of Thunder at 41, then Thundering Strikes at 42-46 and Ancestral Knowledge at 47-51. Shamanistic Focus, Elemental Devastation, Elemental Fury at 54-58 and Lightning Mastery at 59 finish it. No Lava Burst in this build."] = "練功期間打地城的元素配置：坦克抓住成群的怪後用火焰新星和熔岩圖騰，首領用烈焰震擊、大地震擊和閃電箭。先點傳導、烈焰召喚、元素矯捷和元素集中，然後點恢復系的潮汐集中和正念補充法力，30-32級點震盪，33-34級點 Trial by Fire。37級點迴響，38-40級點閃電超載，41級點雷霆召喚，然後42-46級點雷鳴猛擊，47-51級點先祖知識。最後是薩滿之凝、元素破壞，54-58級點元素之怒，59級點閃電專精。此配置不點熔岩爆發。"
L["Enhancement with a two-hander for questing alone, the fastest Shaman solo build: Rockbiter Weapon, Flame Shock and Earth Shock, Stormstrike from 25, Healing Wave between pulls. Thundering Strikes and Mental Dexterity first, Guardian Totems at 18-19, Shamanistic Focus at 20, Elemental Weapons at 21-23, Flurry at 26-27 and Improved Stormstrike after, Maelstrom Weapon at 35-39 and Rage of the Farseer at 40. Then Elemental from 41: Convection, Concussion, Call of Flame at 46-48 and Reverberation from 49, with Elemental Devastation and one point of Tidal Focus last."] = "單人解任務的雙手武器增強配置，是薩滿最快的單人配置：石化武器、烈焰震擊和大地震擊，25級起用風暴打擊，開怪之間用治療波。先點雷鳴猛擊和心靈迅敏，18-19級點守護圖騰，20級點薩滿之凝，21-23級點元素武器，26-27級點亂舞，之後點強化風暴打擊，35-39級點氣漩武器，40級點先知之怒。然後41級起點元素：傳導、震盪，46-48級點烈焰召喚，49級起點迴響，最後點元素破壞和一點潮汐集中。"
L["Elemental for questing alone, about 30% slower than the fastest Shaman solo build: Flame Shock, Lightning Bolt and Earth Shock, a Searing Totem, and Fire Nova once the mob reaches you. Convection first, Elemental Alacrity at 15-17, Call of Flame from 18, Elemental Focus at 20, Tidal Focus and Mindfulness in the 20s for mana, Concussion at 29-31. Then Enhancement: Thundering Strikes at 34-38, Guardian Totems and Improved Lightning Shield around 40. The late levels bring Lightning Overload at 49-51, Elemental Fury at 54-58 and Lightning Mastery at 59."] = "單人解任務的元素配置，比薩滿最快的單人配置慢約30%：烈焰震擊、閃電箭和大地震擊，放一個灼熱圖騰，怪物靠近時用火焰新星。先點傳導，15-17級點元素矯捷，18級起點烈焰召喚，20級點元素集中，20多級點潮汐集中和正念補充法力，29-31級點震盪。然後點增強：34-38級點雷鳴猛擊，40級左右點守護圖騰和強化閃電之盾。後期49-51級點閃電超載，54-58級點元素之怒，59級點閃電專精。"
L["Restoration for questing alone, played like Elemental, about 33% slower than the fastest Shaman solo build: Flame Shock, Lightning Bolt and Earth Shock, a Searing Totem and Fire Nova, Healing Wave between pulls. Tidal Focus and Mindfulness first, then Elemental for damage: Convection at 18-22, Elemental Alacrity at 23-24, Totemic Focus from 26, Water Shield at 29, Elemental Focus at 31. Thundering Strikes at 32-36, Guardian Totems and Ancestral Knowledge around 40, then Improved Healing Wave at 46-47, Mana Tide Totem at 48, Concussion, Trial by Fire and Anticipation."] = "單人解任務的恢復配置，玩法和元素一樣，比薩滿最快的單人配置慢約33%：烈焰震擊、閃電箭和大地震擊，灼熱圖騰和火焰新星，開怪之間用治療波。先點潮汐集中和正念，然後點元素系提升傷害：18-22級點傳導，23-24級點元素矯捷，26級起點圖騰集中，29級點水之盾，31級點元素集中。32-36級點雷鳴猛擊，40級左右點守護圖騰和先祖知識，然後46-47級點強化治療波，48級點法力之潮圖騰，接著震盪、Trial by Fire和預知。"
L["Level-60 open-world pack farming as a shield tank: pull about 4 normal mobs, drop Magma Totem, Fire Nova on cooldown, Lightning Shield and Flame Shock, Rockbiter Weapon on your one-hander. Tidal Focus and Mindfulness first, Thundering Strikes and Mental Dexterity, Improved Reincarnation, Water Shield at 28, then Concussion, Call of Flame, Elemental Focus, Elemental Warding at 40 and Trial by Fire at 44, with Guardian Totems, Anticipation, Toughness and Spirit Weapons for survival. No Stormstrike."] = "60級在開放世界以盾牌坦克身分刷成群的怪：拉約4隻普通怪，放下熔岩圖騰，冷卻好就用火焰新星，加上閃電之盾和烈焰震擊，單手武器上石化武器。先點潮汐集中和正念，接著雷鳴猛擊和心靈迅敏、強化復生，28級點水之盾，然後震盪、烈焰召喚、元素集中，40級點元素結界，44級點Trial by Fire，再加上守護圖騰、預知、堅韌和魂化武器提高生存。不點風暴打擊。"
L["A level-60 Elemental farm for the Dire Maul East jump run past Zevrim Thornhoof to Alzzin, taking the bosses and elites one at a time (28 Elemental / 23 Enhancement). Flame Shock, Lava Burst and Earth Shock, with Lightning Bolt to fill; Lightning Shield, Anticipation and Toughness help you survive the hits. Convection, Elemental Alacrity, Call of Flame and Concussion first, Elemental Focus at 20, Lava Burst at 30, Thundering Strikes from 31, then Improved Lightning Shield, Ancestral Knowledge, Shamanistic Focus, Anticipation and Toughness, with Lightning Overload and Elemental Fury at the end."] = "60級元素刷怪，用於厄運之槌東區跳躍路線，越過瑟雷姆·刺蹄到奧茲恩，一次對付一個首領或精英怪（元素28 / 增強23）。烈焰震擊、熔岩爆發和大地震擊，用閃電箭填補；閃電之盾、預知和堅韌幫你承受攻擊。先點傳導、元素矯捷、烈焰召喚和震盪，20級點元素集中，30級點熔岩爆發，31級起點雷鳴猛擊，然後強化閃電之盾、先祖知識、薩滿之凝、預知和堅韌，最後是閃電超載和元素之怒。"
L["Demonology for questing alone, the fastest Warlock solo build (Demonology 31 / Affliction 20). Your demon tanks, the Voidwalker until 20 and then the Succubus, while you curse, DoT and Drain Life, Fearing a second mob. From 43, Demonic Pact lets you sacrifice the Imp for 15% Shadow damage and keep the Succubus out. Unholy Power early, Improved Sayaad at 23-24, Demonic Energies at 26-27, Demonic Brand at 28-30 (Searing Pain marks the target for the Succubus), Demonic Sacrifice at 32, Soul Link at 36 and Master Demonologist at 38-42, then Improved Drains and Pandemic."] = "單人解任務的惡魔學識配置，是術士最快的單人配置（惡魔學識31 / 痛苦20）。由你的惡魔坦怪，20級前是虛空行者，之後是魅魔，你則施放詛咒、上DoT並使用吸取生命，同時恐懼第二隻怪。43級起，惡魔契印讓你犧牲小鬼獲得15%暗影傷害，並在魅魔出場時保留這個加成。前期點邪惡強化，23-24級點強化薩亞德，26-27級點惡魔能量，28-30級點惡魔烙印（灼熱之痛會為魅魔烙印目標），32級點惡魔犧牲，36級點靈魂鏈結，38-42級點惡魔學識大師，然後強化吸取和災疫。"
L["Destruction for questing alone while your demon tanks, about 16% slower than the Demonology solo build in our model. Bane at 10-15 with Improved Corruption at 11, Aftermath from 16, Suppression at 17-20, then Improved Life Tap, Unholy Power, Improved Drains at 29-31, Improved Health Funnel and Fel Vitality in the 30s. The 40s bring Improved Shadow Bolt, Improved Sayaad, Agonizing Flames and Improved Imp, then Demonic Brand, Intensity at 56-59 and a last point in Agonizing Flames."] = "單人解任務的毀滅配置，由惡魔坦怪，在我們的模型中比惡魔學識單人配置慢約16%。10-15級點災禍，11級點強化腐蝕術，16級起點清算，17-20級點鎮壓，然後強化生命分流、邪惡強化，29-31級點強化吸取，30多級點強化生命通道和惡魔活力。40多級點強化暗影箭、強化薩亞德、苦惱之焰和強化小鬼，然後惡魔烙印，56-59級點強烈，最後一點給苦惱之焰。"
L["Demonology for leveling through dungeons (Demonology 33 / Affliction 18), with the Imp out until 20, then the Succubus. Corruption and Bane of Agony on every mob, Shadow Bolt to fill. Improved Imp at 10-13 with Improved Corruption at 11, then Suppression and Unholy Power, Improved Sayaad at 27-29 and Decimation at 32-33. Demonic Sacrifice at 36 is only there to open Soul Link at 39: keep your demon out. Demonic Knowledge, then Master Demonologist at 42-46, then Affliction: Improved Life Tap, Improved Bane of Agony, Pandemic and Nightfall, with Malevolence last."] = "在地城中練功的惡魔學識配置（惡魔學識33 / 痛苦18），20級前帶小鬼，之後帶魅魔。對每一隻怪上腐蝕術和痛苦災厄，用暗影箭填補。10-13級點強化小鬼，期間11級點強化腐蝕術，然後鎮壓和邪惡強化，27-29級點強化薩亞德，32-33級點屠虐。36級的惡魔犧牲只是為了開啟39級的靈魂鏈結：讓你的惡魔留在場上。接著惡魔知識，然後42-46級點惡魔學識大師，然後點痛苦系：強化生命分流、強化痛苦災厄、災疫和夜幕，最後是惡意。"
L["Destruction for leveling through dungeons (Destruction 30 / Affliction 21), with the Imp out until 20, then the Succubus. Immolate, then Conflagrate when it is ready, Shadow Bolt to fill and Shadowburn to finish; from 40 put Bane of Havoc on a second mob. Bane, Aftermath, Shadowburn, Ruin and Conflagrate come first, then Agonizing Flames, Suppression, Fire and Brimstone, Intensity, Bane of Havoc and Shadow and Flame. The rest goes to Affliction: Improved Corruption, Improved Life Tap, Improved Bane of Agony, Pandemic, Nightfall and Malevolence, with Siphon Life at 60."] = "在地城中練功的毀滅配置（毀滅30 / 痛苦21），20級前帶小鬼，之後帶魅魔。獻祭，然後焚燒好了就用，用暗影箭填補，用暗影灼燒收尾；40級起對第二隻怪上浩劫之禍。先點災禍、清算、暗影灼燒、毀滅和焚燒，然後苦惱之焰、鎮壓、硫磺與火焰、強烈、浩劫之禍和暗影與火焰。剩下的點數給痛苦系：強化腐蝕術、強化生命分流、強化痛苦災厄、災疫、夜幕和惡意，60級點生命虹吸。"
L["Level-60 farming: the Dire Maul East jump run (Hydrospawn, the Zevrim jump, then Alzzin), Demonology 31 / Affliction 15 / Destruction 5. The Voidwalker holds the target while you keep Curse of the Elements, Immolate and your DoTs up, use Searing Pain for Demonic Brand and fill with Drain Life; Fear one mob of a pair. Demonic Pact lets you sacrifice the Imp for 15% Shadow damage and keep the Voidwalker out. Improved Corruption and Bane first, Unholy Power at 18-22, then Improved Drains and Improved Bane of Agony, Demonic Sacrifice at 40, Demonic Brand at 43-45, Soul Link at 51, Master Demonologist at 53-57 and Demonic Pact at 58."] = "60級刷怪：厄運之槌東區跳躍路線（海多斯博恩、瑟雷姆跳躍，然後是奧茲恩），惡魔學識31 / 痛苦15 / 毀滅5。虛空行者抓住目標，你保持元素詛咒、獻祭和DoT，用灼熱之痛觸發惡魔烙印，用吸取生命填補；一對怪中恐懼其中一隻。惡魔契印讓你犧牲小鬼獲得15%暗影傷害，並在虛空行者出場時保留這個加成。先點強化腐蝕術和災禍，18-22級點邪惡強化，然後強化吸取和強化痛苦災厄，40級點惡魔犧牲，43-45級點惡魔烙印，51級點靈魂鏈結，53-57級點惡魔學識大師，58級點惡魔契印。"
L["Level-60 farming: the Maraudon Princess run (three elite pairs, then Princess), Affliction 27 / Demonology 24. The Voidwalker holds the target while you keep Immolate and your DoTs up, Searing Pain for Demonic Brand, Drain Life to fill; Fear the second elite of each pair. Improved Corruption first, Unholy Power at 11-15, Improved Voidwalker, Demonic Sacrifice at 29 (only to open Soul Link), Demonic Brand, then Soul Link at 38. The Affliction half follows: Improved Life Tap, Improved Drains, Pandemic, Malevolence, Soul Siphon, Siphon Life at 56 and Shadow Mastery."] = "60級刷怪：瑪拉頓公主路線（三對精英怪，然後是公主），痛苦27 / 惡魔學識24。虛空行者抓住目標，你保持獻祭和DoT，用灼熱之痛觸發惡魔烙印，用吸取生命填補；每一對中恐懼第二隻精英怪。先點強化腐蝕術，11-15級點邪惡強化，接著強化虛空行者，29級點惡魔犧牲（只為了開啟靈魂鏈結），接著惡魔烙印，然後38級點靈魂鏈結。接下來是痛苦系的一半：強化生命分流、強化吸取、災疫、惡意、靈魂虹吸，56級點生命虹吸，接著暗影專精。"
L["Level-60 farming: two-hander Arms that pulls packs in the open world and AoEs them down with Sweeping Strikes, Whirlwind and Cleave. Improved Rend, Cruelty, Deflection and Improved Overpower first, Deep Wounds and Improved Charge in the 20s, Two-Handed Weapon Specialization, Impale, then Sweeping Strikes at 34, Bloodthrill in the 30s, Weaponmaster from 42, then the Fury tree: Unbridled Wrath, Blood Craze, Enrage and Death Wish at 60. It skips Mortal Strike for those Fury talents."] = "60級刷怪：雙手武器的武器配置，在開放世界拉成群的怪，用橫掃攻擊、旋風斬和順劈斬以範圍傷害清掉。先點強化撕裂、殘忍、偏斜和強化壓制，20多級點重傷和強化衝鋒，接著雙手武器專精、穿刺，然後34級點橫掃攻擊，30多級點鮮血快感，42級起點武器大師，然後點狂怒系：怒不可遏、血之狂熱、狂怒，60級點死亡之願。它為了這些狂怒天賦而不點致死打擊。"
L["Level-60 farming: Fury with a two-hander for the Dire Maul East lasher route, six packs of five lashers a run (Fury 33 / Arms 18). Thunder Clap and Rend the pack, Bloodthirst on cooldown, Slam with spare rage and Execute to finish. Improved Rend and Cruelty first, Deflection, Improved Overpower, then Deep Wounds at 25; the 30s bring Unbridled Wrath, Blood Craze, Booming Voice and Enrage, then Death Wish at 43, Gore Drinker, Flurry from 50 and Bloodthirst at 53, with Improved Charge and Two-Handed Weapon Specialization near the end."] = "60級刷怪：用於厄運之槌東區鞭笞者路線的雙手武器狂怒配置，每趟六群、每群五隻鞭笞者（狂怒33 / 武器18）。對整群怪用雷霆一擊和撕裂，冷卻好就用嗜血，多餘的怒氣用猛擊，用斬殺收尾。先點強化撕裂和殘忍，接著偏斜、強化壓制，然後25級點重傷；30多級點怒不可遏、血之狂熱、震耳嗓音和狂怒，然後43級點死亡之願，接著Gore Drinker，50級起點亂舞，53級點嗜血，強化衝鋒和雙手武器專精在接近最後時取得。"
L["Level-60 farming: two-hander Arms for the Maraudon Princess run (three elite pairs, then Princess), Arms 31 / Fury 20. On each pair: Sweeping Strikes, Rend and Thunder Clap, Mortal Strike on cooldown, Overpower when it lights up, Slam with spare rage, Execute to finish. Improved Rend, Cruelty, Deflection and Improved Overpower first, Deep Wounds at 24-26, Two-Handed Weapon Specialization at 29, Sweeping Strikes at 34, Bloodthrill from 35, Weaponmaster from 41 and Mortal Strike at 44, then Unbridled Wrath, Blood Craze and Enrage from the Fury tree."] = "60級刷怪：用於瑪拉頓公主路線（三對精英怪，然後是公主）的雙手武器武器配置，武器31 / 狂怒20。每一對怪：橫掃攻擊、撕裂和雷霆一擊，冷卻好就用致死打擊，壓制亮起時就用，多餘的怒氣用猛擊，用斬殺收尾。先點強化撕裂、殘忍、偏斜和強化壓制，24-26級點重傷，29級點雙手武器專精，34級點橫掃攻擊，35級起點鮮血快感，41級起點武器大師，44級點致死打擊，然後點狂怒系的怒不可遏、血之狂熱和狂怒。"
