L["Retribution to Protection: Solo Leveling"] = "懲戒轉防護：單人練功"
L["Sword and board, pulling the most mobs you survive. Redoubt, Precision and Toughness first, Improved Seal of Fury at 20, Shield Specialization, One-Handed Weapon Specialization and Templar's Bulwark by 30, Reckoning by 36 and Holy Shield at 40, then Deflection, Improved Judgement, Conviction and Iron Creed. Seal of Fury, Judgement and Holy Strike on cooldown, Consecration on packs, Holy Shield on cooldown, Hammer of Justice on one mob. Single pulls below 20, mostly two mobs in the 20s and 30s, three from 40. From 40 it's faster than Retribution; below 40 Retribution is (see Retribution to Protection). Model-based: the simulator doesn't cover this play style."] = "劍盾配置，在能活下來的前提下一次拉最多的怪。先點盾牌壁壘、精確和堅韌，20級點強化憤怒聖印，30級前點盾牌專精、單手武器專精和聖殿騎士之壁壘，36級前點清算，40級點神聖之盾，然後點偏斜、強化審判、定罪和鐵之教條。冷卻好就用憤怒聖印、審判和神聖打擊，成群的怪用奉獻，冷卻好就用神聖之盾，制裁之錘用在一隻怪上。20級前一次拉一隻，20多級和30多級大多拉兩隻，40級起拉三隻。40級起比懲戒更快；40級前懲戒更快（見懲戒轉防護）。基於模型：模擬器不涵蓋這種玩法。"
L["The fastest way to level a Paladin in our model, about 4% faster than staying Retribution: two-hander Retribution from 10 to 39, then Protection with a one-hander and shield from 40, where Holy Shield and multi-mob pulls take over. At 40 put the Protection build on your second talent spec (Forever unlocks it at 40, so no reset cost), or reset your talents at a trainer. Retribution part: as Retribution: Solo Leveling. Model-based."] = "在我們的模型中是聖騎士最快的練功方式，比一直維持懲戒快約4%：10到39級用雙手武器懲戒，40級起改用單手武器加盾牌的防護，由神聖之盾和一次拉多隻怪接手。40級時把防護配置放在你的第二套天賦專精上（Forever在40級開放，所以沒有重置費用），或到訓練師那裡重置天賦。懲戒部分：同懲戒：單人練功。基於模型。"
L["Two-hander Retribution for questing alone, the fastest of the single trees, about 4% behind Retribution to Protection (switch to Protection at 40). Deflection first, then Benediction, Improved Judgement and Conviction, Seal of Command at 20, Pursuit of Justice, Sanctified Judgement and Sacred Arbiter in the 20s, Vengeance at 30, Champion of the Light by 37 and Twist of Light at 40 for its cheaper seals, then Divine Strength, Improved Seals and Reverence from Holy. Open on Judgement of the Crusader, then Seal of Command, Judgement and Holy Strike on cooldown, and Hammer of Justice before a Judgement of Command (it doubles on a stunned target). From 30 pull two mobs and add Consecration."] = "單人解任務的雙手武器懲戒配置，是單一天賦樹中最快的，比懲戒轉防護（40級轉防護）慢約4%。先點偏斜，接著點祈福、強化審判和定罪，20級點命令聖印，20多級點正義追擊、聖化審判和神聖仲裁者，30級點復仇，37級前點光之勇士，40級點聖光折射讓聖印更便宜，然後點神聖系的神聖之力、強化聖印和崇敬。先用十字軍審判開怪，然後冷卻好就用命令聖印、審判和神聖打擊，並在命令審判前先用制裁之錘（對被擊暈的目標傷害加倍）。30級起一次拉兩隻怪並加上奉獻。"
L["Affliction caster for raids with the Succubus out (Affliction 30 / Destruction 21). Keep Corruption, Siphon Life, Immolate and a Bane up, Shadow Bolt to fill, and use Nightfall procs for a quick Shadow Bolt. Key talents: Malevolence, Nightfall, Pandemic, Shadow Mastery, Improved Corruption and Siphon Life, with Improved Shadow Bolt, Bane and Ruin. Same build at Tier 1."] = "團隊用的痛苦施法配置，帶魅魔出場（痛苦30 / 毀滅21）。保持腐蝕術、生命虹吸、獻祭和一個災厄，用暗影箭填補，夜幕觸發時施放快速的暗影箭。關鍵天賦：惡意、夜幕、災疫、暗影專精、強化腐蝕術和生命虹吸，再加上強化暗影箭、災禍和毀滅。T1階段沿用同一配置。"
L["Arcane raid DPS built on Arcane Blast (32 Arcane / 16 Fire / 3 Frost). Build up to four Arcane Blast stacks, spend Missile Barrage procs on free Arcane Missiles, and save Arcane Power and Presence of Mind for burst. Arcane Concentration, Missile Barrage, Arcane Impact, Arcane Mind and Arcane Instability carry the damage, with Incineration from Fire for more Arcane Blast crits (Ignite fills the Fire points). Each stack makes Arcane Blast cost more, so Intellect and Mp5 matter."] = "以秘法衝擊為核心的秘法團隊輸出（秘法32 / 火焰16 / 冰霜3）。疊到四層秘法衝擊，用飛彈彈幕的觸發施放免費的秘法飛彈，並把秘法強化和氣定神閒留到爆發時使用。秘法專注、飛彈彈幕、秘法碰撞、秘法心智和秘法增效提供主要傷害，再加上火焰系的焚化讓秘法衝擊更常致命一擊（點燃填補火焰系點數）。每一層都會讓秘法衝擊的消耗增加，所以智力和每5秒回魔很重要。"
L["Arms with a two-hander for raids (Arms 34 / Fury 17): Mortal Strike on cooldown, Slam with spare rage, Execute at the end. Key talents: Mortal Strike, Improved Tactical Mastery, Weaponmaster and Two-Handed Weapon Specialization, plus Cruelty and Unbridled Wrath from Fury. Tier 1 drops a point of Improved Execute for Spearing Strike."] = "團隊用的雙手武器武器配置（武器34 / 狂怒17）：冷卻好就用致死打擊，多餘的怒氣用猛擊，最後用斬殺。關鍵天賦：致死打擊、強化戰術專精、武器大師和雙手武器專精，再加上狂怒系的殘忍和怒不可遏。T1階段把一點強化斬殺改點穿刺打擊。"
L["Assassination: Mutilate (Raid)"] = "刺殺：截肢（團隊）"
L["Bear raid tank (Feral 32 / Restoration 10 / Balance 9): Maul with spare rage, Primal Bite and Lacerate for threat, with Lacerate stacked on the target. Armor counts for a lot (Dire Bear Form multiplies it). Key talents: Thick Hide, Lacerate, Predatory Strikes, Leader of the Pack, Rend and Tear and Primal Bite, with Ferocity and a point of Natural Reaction; Heart of the Wild and Naturalist from Restoration, Genesis from Balance."] = "熊團隊坦克（野性戰鬥32 / 恢復10 / 平衡9）：多餘的怒氣用槌擊，用Primal Bite和割裂製造仇恨，並在目標身上疊割裂。護甲非常重要（巨熊形態會使護甲成倍提升）。關鍵天賦：厚皮、割裂、猛獸攻擊、獸群領袖、碎裂撕扯和Primal Bite，再加上兇暴和一點自然反應；野性之心和強化治療之觸來自恢復系，起源來自平衡系。"
L["Beast Mastery (31 / 16 Marksmanship / 4 Survival) for raids: shoot from range with your pet out and Summon Hawk on cooldown. The strongest Hunter raid build. Bestial Wrath, Frenzy, Ferocity and Unleashed Fury power the pet and hawks, with Lethal Attacks, Careful Aim, Efficiency and Trueshot Aura from Marksmanship and Improved Tracking from Survival. Same build at Tier 1."] = "團隊用的野獸控制（31 / 射擊16 / 生存4）：帶著寵物在遠程射擊，冷卻好就用召喚獵鷹。獵人最強的團隊配置。狂野怒火、狂亂、兇暴和狂怒釋放強化寵物和獵鷹，再加上射擊系的致命攻擊、仔細瞄準、效率和強擊光環，以及生存系的強化追蹤。T1階段沿用同一配置。"
L["Cat Form DPS for raids (Feral 32 / Restoration 10 / Balance 9). Shred from behind, keep Rake and Rip up, Ferocious Bite at five combo points, and use Shifting Power to turn mana into Energy. Key talents: Shredding Attacks, Predatory Strikes, Blood Frenzy, Leader of the Pack, Rend and Tear and Furor, with Predatory Discipline; Heart of the Wild and Naturalist from Restoration, Genesis from Balance."] = "團隊用的獵豹形態輸出（野性戰鬥32 / 恢復10 / 平衡9）。從背後撕碎，保持掃擊和撕扯，五點連擊點數時用兇猛撕咬，並用Shifting Power把法力轉為能量。關鍵天賦：撕碎攻擊、猛獸攻擊、血之狂暴、獸群領袖、碎裂撕扯和激怒，再加上Predatory Discipline；野性之心和強化治療之觸來自恢復系，起源來自平衡系。"
L["Combat with daggers for raids, Backstab from behind: the strongest Rogue raid build. Puncturing Wounds, Dual Wield Specialization, Aggression, Blade Flurry and Adrenaline Rush, with Malice, Lethality, Improved Slice and Dice and Cold Blood from Assassination, and Opportunity from Subtlety. Keep Slice and Dice up and finish with Eviscerate. Tier 1 moves Cold Blood's point to Lethality."] = "團隊用的匕首戰鬥配置，從背後背刺：盜賊最強的團隊配置。刺傷、雙武器專精、侵略、劍刃亂舞和能量刺激，再加上刺殺系的惡意、致命偷襲、強化切割和冷血，以及敏銳系的伺機而動。保持切割，用剔骨收尾。T1階段把冷血的點數移到致命偷襲。"
L["Combat with swords for raids: Sinister Strike and Eviscerate with Slice and Dice up, Blade Flurry and Adrenaline Rush on cooldown. Hack and Slash, Weapon Expertise, Aggression and Dual Wield Specialization carry it, with Malice, Ruthlessness, Relentless Strikes and Lethality from Assassination. Same build at Tier 1."] = "團隊用的劍戰鬥配置：保持切割，用邪惡攻擊和剔骨，冷卻好就用劍刃亂舞和能量刺激。劈斬、武器專家、侵略和雙武器專精是核心，再加上刺殺系的惡意、無情、無情打擊和致命偷襲。T1階段沿用同一配置。"
L["Combat: Daggers (Raid)"] = "戰鬥：匕首（團隊）"
L["Demonology caster for raids (Demonology 31 / Destruction 18 / Affliction 2), the strongest Warlock raid build. Before the pull, sacrifice the Imp and summon the Succubus: Demonic Pact keeps the sacrifice bonus, and Soul Link and Master Demonologist work off the Succubus. Keep Corruption, Immolate and a Bane up, Shadow Bolt to fill. Key talents: Master Demonologist, Demonic Pact, Soul Link, Improved Shadow Bolt, Bane and Ruin. Same build at Tier 1."] = "團隊用的惡魔學識施法配置（惡魔學識31 / 毀滅18 / 痛苦2），是術士最強的團隊配置。開怪前犧牲小鬼並召喚魅魔：惡魔契印保留犧牲的加成，靈魂鏈結和惡魔學識大師則依靠魅魔運作。保持腐蝕術、獻祭和一個災厄，用暗影箭填補。關鍵天賦：惡魔學識大師、惡魔契印、靈魂鏈結、強化暗影箭、災禍和毀滅。T1階段沿用同一配置。"
L["Shadow Bolt caster with the Imp out, for raids (Affliction 22 / Destruction 18 / Demonology 11). Keep Corruption, Immolate and a Bane on the boss, Shadow Bolt to fill. Key talents: Improved Shadow Bolt, Bane, Ruin, Improved Imp and Agonizing Flames, plus Malevolence, Pandemic and Nightfall. No Demonic Sacrifice: the Imp stays out. Tier 1 moves a point from Fel Vitality to Unholy Power."] = "團隊用的暗影箭施法配置，帶小鬼出場（痛苦22 / 毀滅18 / 惡魔學識11）。在首領身上保持腐蝕術、獻祭和一個災厄，用暗影箭填補。關鍵天賦：強化暗影箭、災禍、毀滅、強化小鬼和苦惱之焰，再加上惡意、災疫和夜幕。不點惡魔犧牲：小鬼一直留在場上。T1階段把一點惡魔活力移到邪惡強化。"
L["Discipline raid healer built on Power Word: Shield and Penance: shield the tanks, then Penance and Heal on shielded targets (Renewed Hope adds crit while Weakened Soul is up, and Divine Aegis turns crit heals into extra shields), with Power Infusion for burst. Improved Power Word: Shield, Soul Warding and Twin Disciplines strengthen the shield and your instants; Holy Specialization, Divine Fury and Inspiration come from Holy. Same build once you have Tier 1 gear."] = "以真言術：盾和懺悟為核心的戒律團隊治療：給坦克上盾，然後對上了盾的目標用懺悟和治療術（虛弱靈魂存在時嶄新希望提高致命一擊，神禦之盾把治療致命一擊轉為額外護盾），爆發時用注入能量。強化真言術：盾、靈魂結界和雙生戒律強化護盾和你的瞬發法術；神聖專精、神聖之怒和靈感來自神聖系。取得T1裝備後沿用同一配置。"
L["Elemental raid caster: Flame Shock, Lava Burst on cooldown, Lightning Bolt as filler, Elemental Mastery for burst. Lightning Overload, Elemental Fury and Concussion carry the damage; Tidal Focus, Ancestral Knowledge and Thundering Strikes add hit, Intellect and crit. Elemental runs short on mana, so Intellect and Mp5 matter. Same build once you have Tier 1 gear."] = "元素團隊施法：烈焰震擊，冷卻好就用熔岩爆發，用閃電箭填補，爆發時用元素精通。閃電超載、元素之怒和震盪提供主要傷害；潮汐集中、先祖知識和雷鳴猛擊提供命中、智力和致命一擊。元素容易缺法力，所以智力和每5秒回魔很重要。取得T1裝備後沿用同一配置。"
L["Enhancement raid melee with a two-hander and Windfury Weapon: Stormstrike on cooldown, Earth Shock into the Stormstrike buff, and Lightning Bolt once Maelstrom Weapon stacks make it cheaper and faster; Rage of the Farseer for burst. Flurry, Elemental Weapons and Improved Stormstrike carry the damage; Water Shield, Mana Tide Totem and Ancestral Knowledge keep mana up. Same build once you have Tier 1 gear."] = "團隊用的增強近戰配置，使用雙手武器和風怒武器：冷卻好就用風暴打擊，在風暴打擊的增益期間用大地震擊，氣漩武器的層數讓閃電箭更便宜、更快時施放閃電箭；爆發時用先知之怒。亂舞、元素武器和強化風暴打擊提供主要傷害；水之盾、法力之潮圖騰和先祖知識維持法力。取得T1裝備後沿用同一配置。"
L["Fireball raid build: Accelerant, Incineration, Ignite, Improved Scorch, Master of Elements, Critical Mass, Fire Power and Combustion, with Ice Shards and Frost Channeling from Frost. Keep Improved Scorch stacked on the boss, and use Heating Up crits to cast a faster Pyroblast."] = "火球術團隊配置：Accelerant、焚化、點燃、強化灼燒、元素大師、火焰重擊、火焰強化和燃燒，再加上冰霜系的寒冰碎片和冰霜導能。在首領身上保持強化灼燒的層數，並利用提高熱量的致命一擊施放更快的炎爆術。"
L["Frostbolt raid build: Improved Frostbolt, Precision, Ice Shards, Shatter, Fingers of Frost, Winter's Chill and Ice Lance, with Improved Channeling, Arcane Concentration, Missile Barrage and Arcane Meditation from Arcane. Spend Missile Barrage procs on free, fast Arcane Missiles."] = "寒冰箭團隊配置：強化寒冰箭、精確、寒冰碎片、碎冰、冰霜之指、深冬之寒和冰霜長矛，再加上秘法系的強化引導、秘法專注、飛彈彈幕和秘法冥想。用飛彈彈幕觸發施放免費又快速的秘法飛彈。"
L["Fury with a two-hander for raids (Fury 31 / Arms 20): Bloodthirst and Whirlwind on cooldown, Heroic Strike with spare rage, Death Wish for the burn. Key talents: Bloodthirst, Flurry, Death Wish and Enrage, with Two-Handed Weapon Specialization, Deep Wounds and Impale from Arms. About as strong as Arms: Raid with the same two-hander; pick it if you want Bloodthirst and Whirlwind instead of Mortal Strike."] = "團隊用的雙手武器狂怒配置（狂怒31 / 武器20）：冷卻好就用嗜血和旋風斬，多餘的怒氣用英勇打擊，爆發期開死亡之願。關鍵天賦：嗜血、亂舞、死亡之願和狂怒，再加上武器系的雙手武器專精、重傷和穿刺。使用相同雙手武器時強度與武器：團隊相當；如果你想用嗜血和旋風斬而不是致死打擊，就選它。"
L["Fury with two one-handers for raids (Fury 32 / Arms 19), the strongest Warrior raid build: Bloodthirst and Whirlwind on cooldown, Heroic Strike with spare rage, Death Wish for the burn. Key talents: Bloodthirst, Flurry, Dual Wield Specialization, Death Wish and Furious Precision, with Improved Tactical Mastery, Deep Wounds and Impale from Arms. Tier 1 drops a point of Enrage for Improved Bloodrage."] = "團隊用的雙持單手武器狂怒配置（狂怒32 / 武器19），是戰士最強的團隊配置：冷卻好就用嗜血和旋風斬，多餘的怒氣用英勇打擊，爆發期開死亡之願。關鍵天賦：嗜血、亂舞、雙武器專精、死亡之願和狂暴精確，再加上武器系的強化戰術專精、重傷和穿刺。T1階段把一點狂怒改點強化血性狂暴。"
L["Fury: Dual Wield (Raid)"] = "狂怒：雙持（團隊）"
L["Fury: Two-Hander (Raid)"] = "狂怒：雙手武器（團隊）"
L["Holy raid healer: Illumination, Holy Power, Healing Light, Divine Favor and Holy Shock, with Spiritual Focus, Divine Intellect and Reverence for steady casting and mana. Swear Oath of Light on the main tank; Boundless Light makes Holy Shock crit more on everyone else, and Infusion of Light speeds up your next Holy Light after a Flash of Light or Holy Shock crit."] = "神聖團隊治療：啟發、神聖之力、治療之光、神恩術和神聖震擊，加上精神集中、神聖智慧和崇敬，讓施法穩定、法力充足。對主坦克立下Oath of Light；Boundless Light讓神聖震擊對其他人更容易致命一擊，聖光灌注則在聖光閃現或神聖震擊致命一擊後加快你的下一個聖光術。"
L["Holy raid healer: Heal and Greater Heal on the tanks, Prayer of Healing and Prayer of Mending for group damage, Renew to fill. Spiritual Guidance and Spiritual Healing raise your healing, Inspiration adds armor after crit heals, and from Discipline Twin Disciplines (stronger Renew and Prayer of Mending), Mental Strength and Meditation help your mana and instants. Prayer of Mending is the last point, at 60. Same build once you have Tier 1 gear."] = "神聖團隊治療：對坦克用治療術和強效治療術，群體傷害用治療禱言和癒合禱言，用恢復填補。精神導引和精神治療提高你的治療量，靈感在治療致命一擊後增加護甲，戒律系的雙生戒律（更強的恢復和癒合禱言）、心靈之力和冥想幫助你的法力和瞬發法術。癒合禱言是最後一點，在60級。取得T1裝備後沿用同一配置。"
L["Moonkin caster for raids (Balance 33 / Restoration 18): Moonfire and Insect Swarm on the boss, Starfire to fill, cast at lower ranks to save mana. Key talents: Moonkin Form, Moonfury, Vengeance, Improved Starfire, Nature's Grace and Insect Swarm, with Heart of the Wild, Nature's Focus and Reflection from Restoration. Same build at Tier 1."] = "團隊用的梟獸施法配置（平衡33 / 恢復18）：對首領上月火術和蟲群，用星火術填補，施放低等級法術以節省法力。關鍵天賦：梟獸形態、月怒、復仇、強化星火術、自然之賜和蟲群，再加上恢復系的野性之心、自然集中和反射。T1階段沿用同一配置。"
L["Marksmanship (28 / 23 Beast Mastery) for raids: shoot from range with your pet out and Summon Hawk on cooldown. Mortal Shots, Barrage, Ranged Weapon Specialization, Careful Aim and Trueshot Aura carry your shots, with Unleashed Fury, Ferocity and Summon Hawk from Beast Mastery. It trails Beast Mastery: Raid, so take it if you prefer Marksmanship. Tier 1 moves a point from Bestial Discipline to Ranged Weapon Specialization."] = "團隊用的射擊（28 / 野獸控制23）：帶著寵物在遠程射擊，冷卻好就用召喚獵鷹。致死射擊、彈幕、遠程武器專精、仔細瞄準和強擊光環強化你的射擊，再加上野獸控制系的狂怒釋放、兇暴和召喚獵鷹。它不如野獸控制：團隊，所以如果你偏好射擊再選它。T1階段把一點野獸戒律移到遠程武器專精。"
L["Assassination with daggers for raids: Mutilate to build, Eviscerate and Slice and Dice to finish, poisons on both blades. Seal Fate, Cold Blood, Vile Poisons, Improved Poisons and Lethality, with Precision, Dual Wield Specialization and Lightning Reflexes from Combat. At Tier 1, move one Seal Fate point to Improved Slice and Dice and one Murder point to the first Subtlety talent."] = "團隊用的匕首刺殺配置：用截肢累積，用剔骨和切割收尾，兩把武器都上毒藥。封印命運、冷血、惡性毒藥、強化毒藥和致命偷襲，再加上戰鬥系的精確、雙武器專精和閃電反射。T1階段把一點封印命運移到強化切割，並把一點謀殺移到敏銳系的第一個天賦。"
L["Protection raid tank (Protection 38 / Arms 8 / Fury 5): Shield Slam and Revenge on cooldown, Sunder Armor to fill, Heroic Strike with spare rage. Key talents: Shield Specialization, Anticipation, Bastion, Defiance, Improved Sunder Armor and Shield Slam, with Deflection from Arms and Cruelty from Fury. Same build at Tier 1."] = "防護團隊坦克（防護38 / 武器8 / 狂怒5）：冷卻好就用盾牌猛擊和復仇，用破甲攻擊填補，多餘的怒氣用英勇打擊。關鍵天賦：盾牌專精、預知、堡壘、挑釁、強化破甲攻擊和盾牌猛擊，再加上武器系的偏斜和狂怒系的殘忍。T1階段沿用同一配置。"
L["Raid tank with a Retribution dip: Redoubt, Anticipation, Reckoning and Holy Shield, with Deflection, Conviction, Improved Judgement and Vindication from Retribution (Vindication lowers the boss's attack power). Shieldsworn at 60 makes Holy Strike hit with your shield, triggering Holy Shield and Shield Specialization mana, while Iron Creed and Sacred Arbiter make Holy Strike your threat and damage-reduction button."] = "團隊坦克配置，點一些懲戒系天賦：盾牌壁壘、預知、清算和神聖之盾，再加上懲戒系的偏斜、定罪、強化審判和辯護（辯護會降低首領的攻擊強度）。60級的Shieldsworn讓神聖打擊以你的盾牌攻擊，觸發神聖之盾和盾牌專精的法力回復，而鐵之教條和神聖仲裁者讓神聖打擊成為你製造仇恨與減傷的按鈕。"
L["Restoration raid healer: Healing Wave (lower ranks are fine) on the tanks, Riptide on cooldown and Chain Heal on the Riptide target for group damage, Healing Stream Totem down and Mana Tide Totem when mana runs low. Tidal Mastery, Healing Way, Purification and Restorative Totems raise your healing; Thundering Strikes and Ancestral Knowledge come from Enhancement. Riptide is the last point, at 60. Same build once you have Tier 1 gear."] = "恢復團隊治療：對坦克用治療波（低等級也沒問題），冷卻好就用激流，群體傷害時對有激流的目標用治療鍊，放下治療之泉圖騰，法力不足時用法力之潮圖騰。潮汐專精、治療之路、淨化和恢復圖騰提高你的治療量；雷鳴猛擊和先祖知識來自增強系。激流是最後一點，在60級。取得T1裝備後沿用同一配置。"
L["Restoration raid healer (Restoration 40 / Balance 11). Keep Rejuvenation and Regrowth rolling, Wild Growth on a hurt party, Swiftmend and Nature's Swiftness for emergencies; cast lower ranks to save mana. Key talents: Wild Growth, Swiftmend, Nature's Swiftness, Gift of Nature, Improved Regrowth, Living Spirit and Bloom, with Heart of the Wild and Nature's Focus early. Genesis, Moonglow and Nature's Splendor come from Balance."] = "恢復團隊治療（恢復40 / 平衡11）。持續保持回春術和癒合，隊伍受傷時用野性痊癒，緊急時用迅癒和自然迅捷；施放低等級法術以節省法力。關鍵天賦：野性痊癒、迅癒、自然迅捷、自然賜福、強化癒合、活化精神和綻放，前期點野性之心和自然集中。起源、月光和自然光采來自平衡系。"
L["Deep Protection for long fights: Redoubt, Anticipation, Toughness, Holy Shield and Reckoning, with Benediction and Divine Intellect for mana and Deflection from Retribution. Shieldsworn lets Holy Strike trigger Shield Specialization mana returns, and Iron Creed adds damage reduction while Righteous Fury is up."] = "適合長時間戰鬥的深度防護配置：盾牌壁壘、預知、堅韌、神聖之盾和清算，加上祈福和神聖智慧提供法力，以及懲戒系的偏斜。Shieldsworn讓神聖打擊能觸發盾牌專精的法力回復，鐵之教條則在正義之怒啟用時提供額外減傷。"
L["Two-handed raid Retribution (30 / 17 Holy / 4 Protection): keep Seal of Command up, with Judgement and Holy Strike on cooldown. Seal of Command, Sanctified Judgement, Improved Seals, Vengeance and Two-Handed Weapon Specialization carry the damage, with Divine Strength, Divine Intellect and Benediction. Champion of the Light turns Intellect into spell damage, so Intellect counts for more than on most melee."] = "團隊用的雙手武器懲戒（30 / 神聖17 / 防護4）：保持命令聖印，冷卻好就用審判和神聖打擊。命令聖印、聖化審判、強化聖印、復仇和雙手武器專精提供主要傷害，再加上神聖之力、神聖智慧和祈福。光之勇士會把智力轉換為法術傷害，所以智力比對大多數近戰職業更有價值。"
L["Shadow raid DPS in Shadowform: keep Shadow Word: Pain up, Mind Blast on cooldown and Mind Flay between. Darkness, Shadow Weaving, Shadow Focus and Improved Mind Blast carry the damage, Vampiric Embrace heals your group, and Twin Disciplines, Mental Strength and Inner Focus come from Discipline. Shadowform is the last point, at 60. With Tier 1 gear, drop the Early Demise point for Mental Agility."] = "暗影形態下的暗影團隊輸出：保持暗言術：痛，冷卻好就用心靈震爆，中間用精神鞭笞。黑暗、暗影之波、暗影集中和強化心靈震爆提供主要傷害，吸血鬼的擁抱治療你的隊伍，雙生戒律、心靈之力和心靈專注來自戒律系。暗影形態是最後一點，在60級。有T1裝備時，把提早消亡的點數改點精神敏銳。"
L["Survival shooting from range: Lightning Reflexes, Surefooted, Predator's Edge and Expose Prey, with Lethal Attacks, Efficiency, Careful Aim, Mortal Shots and Trueshot Aura. About 20% behind Beast Mastery. Tier 1 moves a point from Resourcefulness to Predator's Edge."] = "在遠程射擊的生存：閃電反射、穩固、掠食者優勢和暴露獵物，再加上致命攻擊、效率、仔細瞄準、致死射擊和強擊光環。比野獸控制落後約20%。T1階段把足智多謀的1點移到掠食者優勢。"
L["Survival: Melee Weave (Raid)"] = "生存：近戰穿插（團隊）"
L["Theorycraft, not a recommendation: Survival that steps into melee between Auto Shots for Raptor Strike, Mongoose Bite and Strider Kick, then back out to 12 yards. Played perfectly in the simulator it beats Beast Mastery by about 15%, but every lost Auto Shot or late step eats that lead, and on a plain ranged rotation these talents are the weakest Hunter build."] = "理論值配置，不推薦：生存獵人在自動射擊之間走進近戰使用猛禽一擊、貓鼬撕咬和陸行鳥腳踢，再退回12碼外。在模擬器中完美操作時比野獸控制強約15%，但每少一次自動射擊或晚一步移動都會吃掉這份領先；若只用一般遠程循環，這套天賦是最弱的獵人配置。"
L["Theorycraft"] = "理論值"
L["|cffc29bffTheorycraft:|r strong only with perfect play in the simulator; not a recommendation."] = "|cffc29bff理論值：|r只有在模擬器中完美操作時才強，並非推薦配置。"
L["Sword and board, pulling the most mobs you survive, about 10% slower than the fastest Paladin solo build. Redoubt and Precision first, Divine Intellect, Shield Specialization at 20, Templar's Bulwark at 22, Toughness, Improved Righteous Fury and Swift Judgement in the 20s, Holy Shield at 30, Reckoning and Iron Creed in the 30s, Shieldsworn at 40, then Benediction, Deflection, Sanctified Judgement, Conviction, Improved Judgement, Pursuit of Justice, Sacred Arbiter and more Divine Intellect. Seal of Fury, Judgement and Holy Strike on cooldown, Consecration on packs, Holy Shield on cooldown, Hammer of Justice on one mob. Single pulls below 20, mostly two mobs in the 20s and 30s, three from 40. Model-based: the simulator doesn't cover this play style."] = "劍盾配置，盡量拉你撐得住的最多怪，比最快的聖騎士單人配置慢約10%。先點盾牌壁壘和精確，接著神聖智慧，20級點盾牌專精，22級點聖殿騎士之壁壘，20多級點堅韌、強化正義之怒和迅捷審判，30級點神聖之盾，30多級點清算和鐵之教條，40級點 Shieldsworn，然後是祈福、偏斜、聖化審判、定罪、強化審判、正義追擊、神聖仲裁者，以及更多神聖智慧。冷卻好就用憤怒聖印、審判和神聖打擊，成群的怪用奉獻，神聖之盾冷卻好就用，制裁之錘用在其中一隻怪上。20級前一次拉一隻，20多級和30多級大多拉兩隻，40級起拉三隻。基於模型：模擬器不涵蓋這種玩法。"
L["Two-hander Retribution for questing alone, the fastest Paladin solo build. Open on Judgement of the Crusader, then Seal of Command, Judgement and Holy Strike on cooldown, with Hammer of Justice before a Judgement of Command (it doubles on stunned targets); from 30 pull two mobs and add Consecration. Seal of Command at 20, Sacred Arbiter at 25, Vengeance at 30, Divine Strength from 33, Champion of the Light at 45-49, then Unsealed Wrath at 51 (swing with Seal of Command, then switch seals to release the stored procs)."] = "單人解任務的雙手武器懲戒配置，是聖騎士最快的單人配置。以十字軍審判開場，然後冷卻好就用命令聖印、審判和神聖打擊，在命令審判之前先用制裁之錘（對昏迷的目標傷害加倍）；30級起一次拉兩隻怪並加上奉獻。20級點命令聖印，25級點神聖仲裁者，30級點復仇，33級起點神聖之力，45-49級點光之勇士，然後51級點Unsealed Wrath（用命令聖印揮砍，然後切換聖印來釋放儲存的觸發效果）。"
L["Two-hander Retribution for leveling through dungeons: Seal of Command, Judgement and Holy Strike on cooldown, Consecration once the tank holds the pack, and Judgement of the Crusader on bosses, not trash. Benediction at 10, Conviction, then Seal of Command at 20, Sacred Arbiter at 25, Two-Handed Weapon Specialization, Vengeance at 30, Champion of the Light from 35, then Unsealed Wrath at 40 (swing with Seal of Command, then switch seals to release the stored procs). Then Holy: Spiritual Focus, Improved Seals, Purifying Power and the rest."] = "在地城中練功的雙手武器懲戒配置：冷卻好就用命令聖印、審判和神聖打擊，坦克抓住整群怪後放奉獻，首領戰使用十字軍審判，小怪則不用。10級點祈福，接著定罪，然後20級點命令聖印，25級點神聖仲裁者，接著雙手武器專精，30級點復仇，35級起點光之勇士，然後40級點Unsealed Wrath（用命令聖印揮砍，然後切換聖印來釋放儲存的觸發效果）。之後點神聖系：精神集中、強化聖印、淨化能量和其餘天賦。"
L["Tanking dungeons while leveling with a one-hander and shield. Seal of Fury, Judgement and Holy Strike on cooldown, Consecration from 20 to hold packs, and Retribution Aura (its damage is much of your threat). Redoubt first, then Precision, Divine Intellect, Shield Specialization at 20-21, Benediction at 22-26, Sanctified Judgement at 27-29, Templar's Bulwark at 30, Swift Judgement at 33 for a second Judgement, then Divine Strength and Reverence. Improved Righteous Fury at 41-43, Holy Shield at 45, then Holy: Improved Seals, Holy Conduit, Reckoning at 51, Healing Light, Purifying Power, Divine Favor and Consecrated Ground last."] = "練功期間使用單手武器和盾牌在地城坦怪。冷卻好就用憤怒聖印、審判和神聖打擊，20級起用奉獻抓住整群怪，並開懲戒光環（它的傷害是你仇恨的一大來源）。先點盾牌壁壘，接著精確、神聖智慧，20-21級點盾牌專精，22-26級點祈福，27-29級點聖化審判，30級點聖殿騎士之壁壘，33級點迅捷審判取得第二次審判，然後神聖之力和崇敬。41-43級點強化正義之怒，45級點神聖之盾，然後點神聖系：強化聖印、神聖導體，51級點清算，接著治療之光、淨化能量、神恩術，最後是神聖之地。"
L["Healing groups through dungeons from 10 to 59. Divine Strength first, Reverence at 15 (mana keeps coming while you cast) and Healing Light, Divine Favor at 20, Illumination from 21, Oath of Light at 25 on the tank (one friendly target, lasts 5 minutes, its healing grows with your level), Infusion of Light, Holy Conduit, Holy Shock at 30 for emergencies, Boundless Light, Divine Precision, Holy Power from 35 and Light's Vigil at 40 to heal the whole party at once. Your rest between pulls is what slows a group down, so Reverence and Illumination come early. Afterwards Benediction, Conviction, Deflection, Consecrated Ground, Improved Judgement, Sanctified Judgement and Divine Intellect."] = "從10級到59級在地城中為隊伍治療的配置。先點神聖之力，15級點崇敬（施法時法力仍會持續恢復）和治療之光，20級點神恩術，21級起點啟發，25級點 Oath of Light 放在坦克身上（一個友方目標，持續5分鐘，治療量隨你的等級成長），接著聖光灌注、神聖導體，30級點神聖震擊應付緊急狀況，然後 Boundless Light、神性精準，35級起點神聖之力，40級點聖光戒備一次治療整個隊伍。拖慢隊伍的是你在開怪之間的休息，所以崇敬和啟發要早點。之後是祈福、定罪、偏斜、神聖之地、強化審判、聖化審判和神聖智慧。"
L["Holy for questing alone while staying ready to heal a group, about 4% slower than the fastest Paladin solo build. Play it like Retribution: Judgement of the Crusader to open, then your seal (Seal of Command from 32); from 30 pull two mobs and add Consecration, and Holy Shock once you have it. Divine Strength first, Holy Conduit at 20, Benediction from 22, Seal of Command at 32, Healing Light from 38, Divine Precision at 40, Sacred Arbiter at 41, Holy Shock at 47, then Consecrated Ground, Two-Handed Weapon Specialization and Vengeance."] = "單人解任務的神聖配置，同時隨時準備治療隊伍，比聖騎士最快的單人配置慢約4%。玩法和懲戒一樣：以十字軍審判開場，然後上你的聖印（32級起用命令聖印）；30級起一次拉兩隻怪並加上奉獻，有了神聖震擊後也使用它。先點神聖之力，20級點神聖導體，22級起點祈福，32級點命令聖印，38級起點治療之光，40級點神性精準，41級點神聖仲裁者，47級點神聖震擊，然後神聖之地、雙手武器專精和復仇。"
L["Two-hander Retribution from 10 to 39, then Protection with a one-hander and shield from 40, where multi-mob pulls take over. It levels about 3% slower than the fastest Paladin solo build (staying Retribution), so take it if you want to tank from 40. At 40 load Protection: Solo Leveling on your second talent spec (Forever unlocks it at 40, so no reset cost), or reset your talents at a trainer. Retribution part: Deflection first, Seal of Command at 20, Sacred Arbiter at 25, Vengeance at 30, then Champion of the Light at 35-39."] = "10到39級用雙手武器懲戒，40級起改用單手武器和盾牌的防護，這時多怪拉怪成為主流。練功速度比聖騎士最快的單人配置（一直玩懲戒）慢約3%，所以如果你想從40級開始坦怪就選它。40級時在你的第二天賦專精載入防護：單人練功（Forever在40級開放第二天賦，因此沒有重置費用），或到訓練師那裡重置天賦。懲戒部分：先點偏斜，20級點命令聖印，25級點神聖仲裁者，30級點復仇，然後35-39級點光之勇士。"
L["Sword and board from 40, pulling the most mobs you survive. Spend the points at 40 on Redoubt, Precision, Sacred Duty, Templar's Bulwark, Shield Specialization, Toughness, Swift Judgement, Improved Righteous Fury, Holy Shield, Reckoning, Iron Creed and Shieldsworn, then Benediction from 41, Conviction in the mid 40s, Deflection from 50, Pursuit of Justice and Anticipation from 57. Seal of Fury, Judgement and Holy Strike on cooldown, Consecration on packs, Holy Shield on cooldown, Hammer of Justice on one mob, mostly three mobs per pull. Model-based: the simulator doesn't cover this play style."] = "40級起的劍盾配置，盡量拉你撐得住的最多怪。40級時把點數花在盾牌壁壘、精確、神聖職務、聖殿騎士之壁壘、盾牌專精、堅韌、迅捷審判、強化正義之怒、神聖之盾、清算、鐵之教條和 Shieldsworn，然後41級起點祈福，40多級中段點定罪，50級起點偏斜，57級起點正義追擊和預知。冷卻好就用憤怒聖印、審判和神聖打擊，成群的怪用奉獻，神聖之盾冷卻好就用，制裁之錘用在其中一隻怪上，大多一次拉三隻。基於模型：模擬器不涵蓋這種玩法。"
L["Two-hander Arms for questing alone, the fastest Warrior solo build (Arms 31 / Fury 20). Keep Rend on every mob; spend rage on Overpower first, then Slam, and finish with Execute. Improved Rend first, Cruelty at 13, Deep Wounds at 21-23, Spearing Strike at 26 (75% weapon damage, double against Giants and Dragonkin), Two-Handed Weapon Specialization at 27-29, Sweeping Strikes at 31, Bloodthrill at 32-33 (your hits on a target with your Rend can open Overpower), Weaponmaster from 34, Improved Slam at 36, then Unbridled Wrath from 45 and Enrage at 50-54."] = "單人解任務的雙手武器武器系配置，是戰士最快的單人配置（武器31 / 狂怒20）。每隻怪都保持撕裂；怒氣先用在壓制，然後猛擊，最後用斬殺收尾。先點強化撕裂，13級點殘忍，21-23級點重傷，26級點穿刺打擊（75%武器傷害，對巨人和龍類加倍），27-29級點雙手武器專精，31級點橫掃攻擊，32-33級點鮮血快感（你攻擊帶有你撕裂效果的目標時可能觸發壓制），34級起點武器大師，36級點強化猛擊，然後45級起點怒不可遏，50-54級點狂怒。"
L["Dual-wield Fury for questing alone, with two one-handers, about 13% slower than the fastest Warrior solo build (Fury 43 / Arms 8). Rend each mob, Bloodthirst on cooldown from 41, Whirlwind on packs, Heroic Strike with spare rage, Execute to finish. Cruelty first, Unbridled Wrath at 16-20, Enrage at 21-25, Dual Wield Specialization and Furious Precision from 26, Death Wish at 31, Flurry at 36-38, Bloodthirst at 41, Deflection from 47, Improved Whirlwind at 51-52, then Piercing Howl, Reckless Swings and Improved Intercept."] = "單人解任務的雙持狂怒配置，使用兩把單手武器，比戰士最快的單人配置慢約13%（狂怒43 / 武器8）。每隻怪上撕裂，41級起冷卻好就用嗜血，成群怪用旋風斬，多餘怒氣用英勇打擊，最後用斬殺收尾。先點殘忍，16-20級點怒不可遏，21-25級點狂怒，26級起點雙武器專精和Furious Precision，31級點死亡之願，36-38級點亂舞，41級點嗜血，47級起點偏斜，51-52級點強化旋風斬，然後刺耳怒吼、Reckless Swings和強化攔截。"
L["Sword and board for questing alone: about 11% slower than the fastest Warrior solo build, but you take far less damage and rarely eat (Protection 31 / Fury 19 / Arms 1). Revenge whenever it lights up, Thunder Clap when you have two mobs, Shield Slam on cooldown from 45. Shield Specialization first, Cruelty at 22-26, Anticipation from 28 with Vanguard (Charge in Defensive Stance) at 30, Last Stand at 34, Concussion Blow at 38, Bastion at 40-44 and Shield Slam at 45, then Unbridled Wrath, Enrage and Blood Craze from Fury."] = "單人解任務的劍盾配置：比戰士最快的單人配置慢約11%，但你承受的傷害少得多，很少需要停下來吃東西（防護31 / 狂怒19 / 武器1）。復仇一亮起就用，有兩隻怪時用雷霆一擊，45級起冷卻好就用盾牌猛擊。先點盾牌專精，22-26級點殘忍，28級起點預知，30級點守禦先鋒（防禦姿態下可用衝鋒），34級點破釜沉舟，38級點震盪猛擊，40-44級點堡壘，45級點盾牌猛擊，然後點狂怒系的怒不可遏、狂怒和血之狂熱。"
L["Two-hander Arms for dungeons while leveling. Improved Rend first, then Improved Heroic Strike, Improved Overpower at 15-16, Improved Tactical Mastery at 17-19, Anger Management at 20 and Improved Charge at 21-22, Deep Wounds from 23, Spearing Strike at 25, Two-Handed Weapon Specialization at 26-28, Sweeping Strikes at 30 for packs, Bloodthrill at 31-32, Weaponmaster from 33, Improved Slam at 35 and Impale at 39-40. Then Booming Voice and Unbridled Wrath in the Fury tree, Mortal Strike at 52, Piercing Howl, Improved Hamstring, Lingering Rage and a point of Cruelty. On packs: Sweeping Strikes and Cleave; on bosses: Overpower, Mortal Strike and Execute."] = "練功期間打地城的雙手武器武器戰配置。先點強化撕裂，然後強化英勇打擊，15-16級點強化壓制，17-19級點強化戰術專精，20級點憤怒掌控，21-22級點強化衝鋒，23級起點重傷，25級點穿刺打擊，26-28級點雙手武器專精，30級點橫掃攻擊對付成群的怪，31-32級點鮮血快感，33級起點武器大師，35級點強化猛擊，39-40級點穿刺。然後點狂怒系的震耳嗓音和怒不可遏，52級點致死打擊，接著刺耳怒吼、強化斷筋、Lingering Rage和一點殘忍。成群的怪用橫掃攻擊和順劈斬；首領用壓制、致死打擊和斬殺。"
L["Sword and board tanking for dungeons while leveling (Protection 31 / Arms 19 / Fury 1). Revenge on cooldown, Shield Slam from 44, Sunder Armor on the main target, Thunder Clap and Demoralizing Shout on packs, Heroic Strike or Cleave with spare rage. Shield Specialization and Improved Revenge first, Improved Thunder Clap, Master of Defense at 20-21, Deflection, Improved Bloodrage, Last Stand at 29, Anticipation from 30, Concussion Blow at 34 (Shield Slam requires it), Focused Rage, Bastion at 39-43, then Shield Slam at 44. After that the Arms tree: Improved Tactical Mastery, Improved Charge, Anger Management, Improved Rend, Deep Wounds and Impale, with a point of Cruelty last."] = "練功期間在地城坦怪的劍盾配置（防護31 / 武器19 / 狂怒1）。冷卻好就用復仇，44級起用盾牌猛擊，對主要目標用破甲攻擊，成群的怪用雷霆一擊和挫志怒吼，多餘的怒氣用英勇打擊或順劈斬。先點盾牌專精和強化復仇，接著強化雷霆一擊，20-21級點防禦大師，接著偏斜、強化血性狂暴，29級點破釜沉舟，30級起點預知，34級點震盪猛擊（盾牌猛擊需要它），接著集中怒氣，39-43級點堡壘，然後44級點盾牌猛擊。之後點武器系：強化戰術專精、強化衝鋒、憤怒掌控、強化撕裂、重傷和穿刺，最後是一點殘忍。"
L["Beast Mastery shooting with the pet tanking, about 4% slower than the fastest Hunter solo build: Serpent Sting on each mob, Arcane Shot on cooldown and Auto Shot between. Deadly Aspects and Lethal Attacks first, Focused Fire at 16-17, Efficiency from 22, Endurance Training from 24, Pathfinding at 30, Rapid Killing at 31, Unleashed Fury from 34, Ferocity from 40, Bestial Discipline at 42-43 and Spirit Bond at 44-45. Then Improved Stings at 46-48, Trueshot Aura at 49 and Improved Arcane Shot from 50. It skips Bestial Wrath and Frenzy."] = "由寵物坦怪的野獸控制遠程射擊配置，比獵人最快的單人配置慢約4%：每隻怪上毒蛇釘刺，冷卻好就用秘法射擊，其間用自動射擊。先點致命守護和致命攻擊，16-17級點專注之火，22級起點效率，24級起點耐久訓練，30級點尋路，31級點急速殺戮，34級起點狂怒釋放，40級起點兇暴，42-43級點野獸戒律，44-45級點靈魂聯結。然後46-48級點強化釘刺，49級點強擊光環，50級起點強化秘法射擊。不點狂野怒火和狂亂。"
L["Marksmanship shooting with the pet tanking, the fastest Hunter solo build: Serpent Sting on each mob, then Arcane Shot and Aimed Shot on cooldown between Auto Shots. Lethal Attacks, Careful Aim and Efficiency first, Rapid Killing at 20-21, Trueshot Aura at 25, Improved Stings at 28-29, Rapid Recuperation at 30-31 and Barrage at 32-33. Then Deadly Aspects at 34-38 and Focused Fire from Beast Mastery, Ranged Weapon Specialization at 42-46, then Improved Aspect of the Monkey, Pathfinding, Unleashed Fury and Improved Mend Pet as the last points."] = "由寵物坦怪的射擊配置，是獵人最快的單人配置：每隻怪上毒蛇釘刺，然後在自動射擊之間冷卻好就用秘法射擊和瞄準射擊。先點致命攻擊、仔細瞄準和效率，20-21級點急速殺戮，25級點強擊光環，28-29級點強化釘刺，30-31級點急速回能，32-33級點彈幕。然後34-38級點致命守護和野獸控制系的專注之火，42-46級點遠程武器專精，最後幾點給強化靈猴守護、尋路、狂怒釋放和強化治療寵物。"
L["Survival shooting with the pet tanking: you stay at range rather than melee, about 7% slower than the fastest Hunter solo build. Serpent Sting on each mob, then Arcane Shot and Aimed Shot on cooldown. Improved Tracking and Lethal Attacks alternate first, then Survivalist and Efficiency from 20, Clever Traps at 29, Rapid Killing at 31, Surefooted from 34, Careful Aim from 35, Deflection from 40 and Trueshot Aura at 41. Then Resourcefulness at 46-47, Survivalist's Discipline, a point of Lone Wolf at 49 (it only helps with no pet out) and Barrage from 54."] = "由寵物坦怪的生存遠程射擊配置：你保持遠程而不是近戰，比獵人最快的單人配置慢約7%。每隻怪上毒蛇釘刺，然後冷卻好就用秘法射擊和瞄準射擊。先交替點強化追蹤和致命攻擊，然後20級起點生存技能專家和效率，29級點靈巧陷阱，31級點急速殺戮，34級起點穩固，35級起點仔細瞄準，40級起點偏斜，41級點強擊光環。然後46-47級點足智多謀，接著生存專家戒律，49級點一點孤狼（只在沒有寵物時有幫助），54級起點彈幕。"
L["Beast Mastery shooting for dungeons while leveling. Deadly Aspects and Lethal Attacks first, then Focused Fire, Careful Aim from 21, Endurance Training, Efficiency, Unleashed Fury from 30 and Rapid Killing at 31 and 33. Ferocity at 37-41 and Bestial Discipline at 42-43 finish the pet side. Then the rest of Careful Aim and Efficiency, Trueshot Aura at 47, Mortal Shots at 48-51, Rapid Recuperation at 52, then Improved Tracking from 56, with Barrage and Spirit Bond mixed in. Let the tank hold the mobs: your pet attacks the tank's target, and Multi-Shot only once the tank has the pack."] = "練功期間打地城的野獸控制射擊配置。先點致命守護和致命攻擊，然後專注之火，21級起點仔細瞄準，接著耐久訓練、效率，30級起點狂怒釋放，31級和33級點急速殺戮。37-41級的兇暴和42-43級的野獸戒律完成寵物這一側。然後是仔細瞄準和效率的剩餘點數，47級點強擊光環，48-51級點致死射擊，52級點急速回能，然後56級起點強化追蹤，中間穿插彈幕和靈魂聯結。讓坦克穩住怪物：你的寵物攻擊坦克的目標，多重射擊等坦克抓住整群怪後再用。"
L["Marksmanship for dungeons while leveling: shoot from range, let the tank hold the mobs and use Multi-Shot only once the tank has the pack. Lethal Attacks, Careful Aim and Rapid Killing first, Efficiency and Improved Stings in the 20s, Trueshot Aura at 25 (it also helps other Hunters in the group), Rapid Recuperation at 30-31, then Barrage at 32-33 and 35. Improved Tracking from 34 and Ranged Weapon Specialization from 36 alternate, with Lone Wolf at 40: from then on dismiss your pet in groups, as 20% more damage beats it. Sniper Shot at 48, then Survival talents (Entrapment, Surefooted, Clever Traps, Scatter Shot, Savage Strikes) and Deadly Aspects fill the 50s."] = "練功期間打地城的射擊配置：在遠程射擊，讓坦克抓住怪，坦克穩住整群怪之後才用多重射擊。先點致命攻擊、仔細瞄準和急速殺戮，20多級點效率和強化釘刺，25級點強擊光環（它也會幫助隊伍中的其他獵人），30-31級點急速回能，然後32-33級和35級點彈幕。34級起點強化追蹤，36級起點遠程武器專精，兩者交替，40級點孤狼：從此在組隊時解散你的寵物，因為多20%傷害勝過寵物。48級點狙擊，然後生存系天賦（誘捕、穩固、靈巧陷阱、驅散射擊、猛烈強擊）和致命守護填補50多級的點數。"
L["Frost for questing alone, single target only: Frostbolt and your wand, one or two mobs at a time. Ice Lance a mob while Frost Nova or Frostbite holds it, and Cone of Cold once Winter's Chill has stacked. About 55% slower than the fastest Mage solo build (Frost: AoE Leveling). Improved Frostbolt and Precision first, Frostbite at 17-19, Ice Lance at 20, Shatter at 25-27, Incineration from 34, Improved Cone of Cold at 39-40, Winter's Chill from 42 and Ice Barrier at 44. Arcane from 46: Improved Channeling, Arcane Concentration from 52 and Missile Barrage at 59."] = "單人解任務的冰霜配置，只打單體：寒冰箭和魔杖，一次一兩隻怪。在冰霜新星或霜寒刺骨凍住怪物時對它用冰霜長矛，深冬之寒疊起來後用冰錐術。比法師最快的單人配置（冰霜：範圍練功）慢約55%。先點強化寒冰箭和精確，17-19級點霜寒刺骨，20級點冰霜長矛，25-27級點碎冰，34級起點焚化，39-40級點強化冰錐術，42級起點深冬之寒，44級點寒冰護體。46級起點秘法：強化引導，52級起點秘法專注，59級點飛彈彈幕。"
L["Arcane for questing alone, single target only: one or two mobs at a time, no AoE pulls. Cast Arcane Blast up to four times, then Arcane Missiles (Arcane Missiles alone until Arcane Blast at 22), with Arcane Wrath on cooldown. About 61% slower than the fastest Mage solo build (Frost: AoE Leveling). Arcane Resilience and Precision first, Arcane Concentration from 17, Missile Barrage at 20-21, Arcane Wrath at 27, Arcane Mind at 33-36 and Arcane Power at 42. Frost from 44: Improved Frostbolt, Ice Lance at 53 and Shatter at 56-58."] = "單人解任務的秘法配置，只打單體：一次一兩隻怪，不拉群範圍。施放秘法衝擊最多四次，然後秘法飛彈（22級學到秘法衝擊前只用秘法飛彈），冷卻好就用秘法懲戒。比法師最快的單人配置（冰霜：範圍練功）慢約61%。先點秘法轉化和精確，17級起點秘法專注，20-21級點飛彈彈幕，27級點秘法懲戒，33-36級點秘法心智，42級點秘法強化。44級起點冰霜：強化寒冰箭，53級點冰霜長矛，56-58級點碎冰。"
L["Fire for questing alone, single target only: Fireball and Pyroblast, one or two mobs at a time, no AoE pulls. It is about 86% slower than the fastest Mage solo build (Frost: AoE Leveling). Accelerant and Precision first, Ignite at 17-20, Incineration from 21, Improved Fire Blast at 22-23, Pyroblast at 26 and Heating Up at 27, then Master of Elements at 31, Critical Mass at 32-34 and Fire Power at 37-39. Frost from 40: Improved Frostbolt, Ice Shards at 43-47, Ice Lance at 48, Frost Channeling at 49-51 and Shatter at 53-55, with Improved Scorch from 56 and Combustion at 58."] = "單人解任務的火焰配置，只打單體：火球術和炎爆術，一次一兩隻怪，不拉群範圍。比法師最快的單人配置（冰霜：範圍練功）慢約86%。先點Accelerant和精確，17-20級點點燃，21級起點焚化，22-23級點強化火焰衝擊，26級點炎爆術，27級點提高熱量，然後31級點元素大師，32-34級點火焰重擊，37-39級點火焰強化。40級起點冰霜：強化寒冰箭，43-47級點寒冰碎片，48級點冰霜長矛，49-51級點冰霜導能，53-55級點碎冰，56級起點強化灼燒，58級點燃燒。"
L["Frost for leveling through dungeons: Frostbolt on bosses, then Blizzard and Cone of Cold on packs once the tank holds them (AoE makes a lot of threat). Precision and Improved Frostbolt first, Ice Shards from 15, Frost Channeling at 20-22, Ice Lance at 23, Shatter at 25-27, Improved Cone of Cold at 30-32, Fingers of Frost at 33-34, Winter's Chill at 36-38, Cold Snap at 39 and Ice Barrier at 40. Arcane from 41 for mana: Improved Channeling, Arcane Concentration at 46-50, Missile Barrage, Arcane Impact at 53-55 and Arcane Meditation at 56-58."] = "在地城中練功的冰霜配置：首領用寒冰箭，坦克抓住整群怪後用暴風雪和冰錐術（範圍法術會產生大量仇恨）。先點精確和強化寒冰箭，15級起點寒冰碎片，20-22級點冰霜導能，23級點冰霜長矛，25-27級點碎冰，30-32級點強化冰錐術，33-34級點冰霜之指，36-38級點深冬之寒，39級點急速冷卻，40級點寒冰護體。41級起為了法力點秘法系：強化引導，46-50級點秘法專注，接著飛彈彈幕，53-55級點秘法碰撞，56-58級點秘法冥想。"
L["Arcane for leveling through dungeons (30 Arcane / 18 Fire / 3 Frost): on bosses, four Arcane Blasts, then Arcane Missiles until the stacks run out; Flamestrike and Arcane Explosion on packs once the tank holds them. Improved Channeling and Precision first, Arcane Concentration at 17-21, Arcane Impact and Missile Barrage in the early 20s, Arcane Blast at 26, Arcane Wrath at 27 and Arcane Meditation at 28-30. Arcane Mind at 33-37 and Arcane Instability at 38-40, then Fire from 41: Incineration, Ignite at 46-50, Improved Flamestrike at 51-53, Presence of Mind at 54, Pyroblast, Accelerant and Master of Elements."] = "在地城中練功的秘法配置（秘法 30 / 火焰 18 / 冰霜 3）：首領戰用四次秘法衝擊，然後用秘法飛彈直到層數消失；坦克抓住整群怪後用烈焰風暴和魔爆術。先點強化引導和精確，17-21級點秘法專注，20級出頭點秘法碰撞和飛彈彈幕，26級點秘法衝擊，27級點秘法懲戒，28-30級點秘法冥想。33-37級點秘法心智，38-40級點秘法增效，然後41級起點火焰系：焚化，46-50級點點燃，51-53級點強化烈焰風暴，54級點氣定神閒，接著炎爆術、Accelerant和元素大師。"
L["Fire for leveling through dungeons (31 Fire / 17 Arcane / 3 Frost): Fireball on bosses with Fire Blast on cooldown, Pyroblast at 3 Heating Up stacks once you have it at 28, Flamestrike and Arcane Explosion on packs once the tank holds them. Incineration and Precision first, Ignite at 18-22, Improved Flamestrike at 23-25, Pyroblast at 26, Improved Fire Blast, Heating Up and Master of Elements around 30, Blast Wave at 33, Critical Mass at 34-36, Accelerant and Fire Power at 38-40. Arcane from 41: Improved Channeling, Arcane Concentration at 46-50, Arcane Impact, Arcane Resilience and Arcane Meditation, with Improved Scorch at 57-58 and Combustion at 59."] = "在地城中練功的火焰配置（火焰 31 / 秘法 17 / 冰霜 3）：首領用火球術，冷卻好就用火焰衝擊，28級學到提高熱量後，疊到3層時用炎爆術，坦克抓住整群怪後用烈焰風暴和魔爆術。先點焚化和精確，18-22級點點燃，23-25級點強化烈焰風暴，26級點炎爆術，30級左右點強化火焰衝擊、提高熱量和元素大師，33級點衝擊波，34-36級點火焰重擊，38-40級點Accelerant和火焰強化。41級起點秘法系：強化引導，46-50級點秘法專注，接著秘法碰撞、秘法轉化和秘法冥想，57-58級點強化灼燒，59級點燃燒。"
L["AoE grinding: the fastest Mage solo build, harder to play. Before 20 you kill single mobs with Frostbolt; from 20 you pull packs and Blizzard them down while Improved Blizzard slows them. Frost Nova breaks on damage: use it only for distance, and save Cold Snap for a second Nova. Improved Frostbolt and Precision first, Frostbite at 18, Ice Lance at 20, Improved Blizzard at 24, Shatter at 25-27, Improved Cone of Cold at 33-35, Cold Snap at 38 and Ice Barrier at 40. Arcane from 47: Arcane Resilience and Arcane Concentration at 52-56."] = "範圍練功：法師最快的單人配置，但較難操作。20級前用寒冰箭一次殺一隻怪；20級起拉一群怪，在強化暴風雪使牠們減速時用暴風雪清掉。冰霜新星受到傷害就會解除：只用它來拉開距離，並把急速冷卻留給第二次冰霜新星。先點強化寒冰箭和精確，18級點霜寒刺骨，20級點冰霜長矛，24級點強化暴風雪，25-27級點碎冰，33-35級點強化冰錐術，38級點急速冷卻，40級點寒冰護體。47級起點秘法：52-56級點秘法轉化和秘法專注。"
L["Shadow for questing alone: Shadow Word: Pain, Devouring Plague and Mind Blast, then Mind Flay (the wand before you have it). Spirit Tap first (most of your mana comes back after each kill), then Shadow Focus, Mind Flay at 20 with Improved Mind Flay, Improved Shadow Word: Pain at 23, Shadow Weaving at 25-27, Dark Inspiration, Vampiric Embrace at 29 (Shadowform requires it), Devouring Contagion, Darkness from 35, Early Demise at 39 and Shadowform at 40. From 43 you go into Discipline for mana: Twin Disciplines, Mental Strength, Meditation and Mental Agility, with a point of Improved Mind Blast at 60."] = "單人解任務的暗影配置：暗言術：痛、噬靈瘟疫和心靈震爆，然後精神鞭笞（學會之前用魔杖）。先點精神分流（每殺一隻怪就能回來大部分法力），然後暗影集中，20級點精神鞭笞和強化精神鞭笞，23級點強化暗言術：痛，25-27級點暗影之波，接著 Dark Inspiration，29級點吸血鬼的擁抱（暗影形態需要它），然後吞噬疫病，35級起點黑暗，39級點提早消亡，40級點暗影形態。43級起為了法力點戒律系：雙生戒律、心靈之力、冥想和精神敏銳，60級點一點強化心靈震爆。"
L["Discipline for questing alone, about 37% slower than the fastest Priest solo build: Smite with Shadow Word: Pain, Devouring Plague and Mind Blast, the wand when mana runs low. Wand Specialization and Spirit Tap first, Twin Disciplines from 14, Mental Strength at 23-25, Inner Focus at 26, Meditation at 27-29, Mental Agility from 30, Improved Power Word: Shield at 32-34, Soul Warding at 35 and Shadow Focus at 37-41. Then Improved Mind Blast from 42, Vampiric Embrace at 46, Shadow Weaving at 47-49, Devouring Contagion, Penance at 56, Blackout and Renewed Hope."] = "單人解任務的戒律配置，比牧師最快的單人配置慢約37%：懲擊搭配暗言術：痛、噬靈瘟疫和心靈震爆，法力不足時用魔杖。先點魔杖專精和精神分流，14級起點雙生戒律，23-25級點心靈之力，26級點心靈專注，27-29級點冥想，30級起點精神敏銳，32-34級點強化真言術：盾，35級點靈魂結界，37-41級點暗影集中。然後42級起點強化心靈震爆，46級點吸血鬼的擁抱，47-49級點暗影之波，接著吞噬疫病，56級點懺悟，然後昏厥和嶄新希望。"
L["Holy for questing alone, about 54% slower than the fastest Priest solo build: Smite and Holy Fire with Shadow Word: Pain, Devouring Plague and Mind Blast, the wand when mana runs low. Holy Specialization, Spirit Tap and Wand Specialization first, Divine Fury (a faster Smite) from 22, Shadow Focus from 25, Improved Renew from 32, Improved Mind Blast from 33, Holy Nova at 38 and Twilight Focus at 40. Then Improved Healing, Shadow Weaving from 43, Vampiric Embrace at 45, Searing Light at 48 and Spiritual Guidance from 51."] = "單人解任務的神聖配置，比牧師最快的單人配置慢約54%：懲擊和神聖之火搭配暗言術：痛、噬靈瘟疫和心靈震爆，法力不足時用魔杖。先點神聖專精、精神分流和魔杖專精，22級起點神聖之怒（更快的懲擊），25級起點暗影集中，32級起點強化恢復，33級起點強化心靈震爆，38級點神聖新星，40級點暮光集中。然後強化治療術，43級起點暗影之波，45級點吸血鬼的擁抱，48級點灼熱之光，51級起點精神導引。"
L["Shadow for dungeons while leveling: Shadow Word: Pain on every mob in a pack, Devouring Plague and Mind Flay on the kill target, Mind Blast now and then (it makes a lot of threat). Shadow Focus and Wand Specialization first, Improved Shadow Word: Pain at 17, Spirit Tap at 19-23, Mind Flay at 24 with Improved Mind Flay, Shadow Weaving at 27-29, Dark Inspiration at 30, Vampiric Embrace at 31 (Shadowform requires it; it also heals your party), Devouring Contagion, Darkness at 37-41, Shadowform at 42 and Early Demise. From 45 the rest goes to Discipline for mana: Twin Disciplines, Mental Strength, Meditation and Mental Agility."] = "練功期間打地城的暗影配置：整群怪每隻都上暗言術：痛，主要擊殺目標用噬靈瘟疫和精神鞭笞，偶爾用心靈震爆（它會產生大量仇恨）。先點暗影集中和魔杖專精，17級點強化暗言術：痛，19-23級點精神分流，24級點精神鞭笞和強化精神鞭笞，27-29級點暗影之波，30級點 Dark Inspiration，31級點吸血鬼的擁抱（暗影形態需要它；它也會治療你的隊伍），接著吞噬疫病，37-41級點黑暗，42級點暗影形態，然後提早消亡。45級起其餘點數為了法力給戒律系：雙生戒律、心靈之力、冥想和精神敏銳。"
L["Discipline healing for dungeons while leveling, the stronger Priest healer: Renew on the tank, Power Word: Shield before big pulls, Penance and Heal for big hits, Prayer of Healing when the whole group is hurt. Twin Disciplines first, Mental Strength at 15-19, Meditation at 20, Inner Focus at 23, Improved Renew at 24, Mental Agility at 27, Improved Power Word: Shield at 30, Penance at 33, then Renewed Hope from 37 and Divine Aegis at 40. Holy after that: Holy Specialization, Divine Fury at 47-51, Inspiration and Improved Healing."] = "練功期間在地城治療的戒律配置，是較強的牧師治療：對坦克上恢復，大拉怪前上真言術：盾，大傷害時用懺悟和治療術，全隊受傷時用治療禱言。先點雙生戒律，15-19級點心靈之力，20級點冥想，23級點心靈專注，24級點強化恢復，27級點精神敏銳，30級點強化真言術：盾，33級點懺悟，然後37級起點嶄新希望，40級點神禦之盾。之後點神聖系：神聖專精，47-51級點神聖之怒，接著靈感和強化治療術。"
L["Holy healing for dungeons while leveling (Discipline is the stronger Priest healer): Renew rolling on the tank, Heal and Greater Heal for big hits, Prayer of Healing when the whole group is hurt, Prayer of Mending on cooldown once you have it. Improved Renew first, Twin Disciplines and Holy Specialization alternate to 22, Mental Strength and Divine Fury in the mid 20s and early 30s, Meditation at 31-35 for mana, Holy Nova at 36, Inner Focus at 37, Improved Healing at 39-41, Litany of Light, Spiritual Guidance from 46, Spiritual Healing at 49-51, Spirit of Redemption at 53 and Prayer of Mending at 54, then Holy Reach and Power in Light."] = "練功期間在地城治療的神聖配置（戒律是較強的牧師治療）：對坦克持續上恢復，大傷害時用治療術和強效治療術，全隊受傷時用治療禱言，取得癒合禱言後冷卻好就用。先點強化恢復，雙生戒律和神聖專精交替點到22級，20多級中段和30級出頭點心靈之力和神聖之怒，31-35級為了法力點冥想，36級點神聖新星，37級點心靈專注，39-41級點強化治療術，接著聖光連禱，46級起點精神導引，49-51級點精神治療，53級點救贖之魂，54級點癒合禱言，然後神聖延伸和聖光之力。"
L["Affliction for questing alone, about 17% slower than the fastest Warlock solo build; an alternative to Affliction: Solo Leveling played as a Drain Life tank: let mobs come to you, and from 14 Drain Life is your filler, healing you for what it deals. The Voidwalker is out until 20, then the Succubus for damage; neither tanks. Improved Corruption at 10, Soul Harvest at 15-16, Improved Drains at 17-19, Fel Concentration at 20-22, Soul Siphon at 30-32 and Shadow Mastery at 35-39, then Malevolence, Demonic Embrace, Siphon Life at 48, Nightfall and Fel Vitality."] = "單人解任務的痛苦配置，比術士最快的單人配置慢約17%；是痛苦：單人練功的替代方案，以吸取生命坦怪的方式進行：讓怪物走到你面前，14級起吸取生命是你的填補技能，造成多少傷害就治療你多少。20級前召出虛空行者，之後召出魅魔增加傷害；兩者都不負責坦怪。10級點強化腐蝕術，15-16級點靈魂收割，17-19級點強化吸取，20-22級點惡魔專注，30-32級點靈魂虹吸，35-39級點暗影專精，然後惡意、惡魔之擁，48級點生命虹吸，接著夜幕和惡魔活力。"
L["Destruction for questing alone, about 28% slower than the fastest Warlock solo build (Destruction 21 / Affliction 19 / Demonology 11). The Voidwalker tanks until 20, then keep the Succubus out. Immolate, Corruption and Bane of Agony, a wand and later Drain Life to fill, Shadowburn to finish from 59. Bane at 10-18 with Suppression between, Unholy Power at 20-24, Molten Skin at 25 (four more in the mid 40s), Aftermath from 27, Improved Drains at 38-40, Agonizing Flames from 49, then Pandemic and Malevolence."] = "單人解任務的毀滅配置，比術士最快的單人配置慢約28%（毀滅21 / 痛苦19 / 惡魔學識11）。20級前由虛空行者坦怪，之後讓魅魔一直在場。獻祭、腐蝕術和痛苦災厄，用魔杖、之後用吸取生命填補，59級起用暗影灼燒收尾。10-18級點災禍，中間穿插鎮壓，20-24級點邪惡強化，25級點熔火之膚（40多級中段再點四點），27級起點清算，38-40級點強化吸取，49級起點苦惱之焰，然後災疫和惡意。"
L["Tanking groups through dungeons with a one-hander, a shield and Rockbiter Weapon: Earth Shock for single-target threat, Fire Nova (and Magma Totem from 26) on packs, Lightning Shield for damage on every hit taken. Thundering Strikes and Mental Dexterity first, then Tidal Focus at 18-22, Mindfulness, Ancestral Knowledge, Shamanistic Focus at 28, Totemic Focus from Restoration for mana, and Water Shield at 31. Elemental Weapons from 32, Stormstrike at 36 and Flurry at 37-40, then 41-42 go to Improved Stormstrike. Convection at 44-48 and Call of Flame at 49-51 start the Elemental side, then Reverberation, Elemental Focus, Mental Quickness at 55-56 and Spirit Weapons at 57."] = "用單手武器、盾牌和石化武器在地城中為隊伍坦怪的配置：單一目標仇恨用大地震擊，成群的怪用火焰新星（26級起再加熔岩圖騰），閃電之盾讓你每次被擊中都造成傷害。先點雷鳴猛擊和心靈迅敏，然後18-22級點潮汐集中，接著正念、先祖知識，28級點薩滿之凝，為了法力點恢復系的圖騰集中，31級點水之盾。32級起點元素武器，36級點風暴打擊，37-40級點亂舞，然後41-42級點強化風暴打擊。44-48級點傳導、49-51級點烈焰召喚，開始元素系，然後迴響、元素集中，55-56級點思想迅捷，57級點魂化武器。"
L["Feral for questing alone: Bear Form until 20, then Cat Form, the fastest Druid solo build. Ferocity first, Feral Swiftness at 15-16, Furor at 17-19, Sharpened Claws and Savage Fury at 20-23, Predatory Strikes at 25-27, Blood Frenzy at 28-29 and Leader of the Pack at 30. Then Genesis, Nature's Reach and Nature's Majesty from Balance at 31-39, Heart of the Wild and Naturalist from Restoration in the 40s, Natural Instinct at 50-51, Predatory Discipline at 53, Rend and Tear at 54-58, and Shredding Attacks and Natural Reaction last. Claw to build combo points, Rake on every mob, Ferocious Bite or Rip to finish."] = "單人解任務的野性戰鬥配置：20級前用熊形態，之後用獵豹形態，是最快的德魯伊單人配置。先點兇暴，15-16級點野性迅捷，17-19級點激怒，20-23級點鋒利獸爪和野蠻暴怒，25-27級點猛獸攻擊，28-29級點血之狂暴，30級點獸群領袖。然後31-39級點平衡系的起源、自然延伸和自然威嚴，40多級點恢復系的野性之心和強化治療之觸，50-51級點 Natural Instinct，53級點 Predatory Discipline，54-58級點碎裂撕扯，最後是撕碎攻擊和自然反應。用爪擊累積連擊點數，每隻怪都上掃擊，用兇猛撕咬或撕扯收尾。"
L["Balance caster for questing alone, about 34% slower than the fastest Druid solo build: open with Moonfire and Insect Swarm, then Starfire, or Wrath below 20. Improved Wrath first, Moonglow and Nature's Reach from 15, Nature's Majesty at 20-21, Nature's Splendor at 22, Improved Moonfire at 23-24, Improved Starfire at 25-29, Insect Swarm at 30, Eclipse at 31-33, Vengeance from 34 and Moonfury at 35-39. Then Restoration: Heart of the Wild at 40-44, Reflection and Naturalist in the late 40s, with Moonkin Form at 55 and Nature's Focus last."] = "單人解任務的平衡施法配置，比德魯伊最快的單人配置慢約34%：以月火術和蟲群開場，然後星火術，20級前用憤怒。先點強化憤怒，15級起點月光和自然延伸，20-21級點自然威嚴，22級點自然光采，23-24級點強化月火術，25-29級點強化星火術，30級點蟲群，31-33級點蝕星蔽月，34級起點復仇，35-39級點月怒。然後點恢復：40-44級點野性之心，40多級後段點反射和強化治療之觸，55級點梟獸形態，最後點自然集中。"
L["Restoration for questing alone while staying ready to heal a group, about 42% slower than the fastest Druid solo build (Restoration 25 / Balance 24 / Feral 2). Play it like Balance: Moonfire, then Starfire or Wrath, and heal yourself between pulls. Heart of the Wild first, then Reflection and Naturalist, Genesis at 23-27 and Moonglow at 28-30. The 30s and 40s mix Balance damage (Improved Moonfire, Insect Swarm at 41, Improved Starfire) with Gift of Nature; Living Spirit, Vengeance and Bloom come last."] = "單人解任務的恢復配置，同時隨時準備治療隊伍，比德魯伊最快的單人配置慢約42%（恢復25 / 平衡24 / 野性戰鬥2）。玩法和平衡一樣：月火術，然後星火術或憤怒，並在拉怪之間治療自己。先點野性之心，然後反射和強化治療之觸，23-27級點起源，28-30級點月光。30多級和40多級混合平衡系的傷害天賦（強化月火術、41級的蟲群、強化星火術）和自然賜福；活化精神、復仇和綻放最後點。"
L["Feral Cat for dungeons while leveling: Shred from behind (with Shredding Attacks it beats Claw per Energy), Rake and Rip. Ferocity first, Furor at 15-17, Feral Swiftness at 18, Thick Hide at 19, Shredding Attacks at 20-22, Sharpened Claws and Savage Fury at 23-26, Predatory Strikes at 27-29, Leader of the Pack at 30, Blood Frenzy at 31-32, Natural Instinct at 33, Predatory Discipline at 34, Rend and Tear at 35-39 and Shifting Power at 40. Then Heart of the Wild and Naturalist from Restoration in the 40s, Natural Shapeshifter from 51, the second point of Natural Instinct, Natural Reaction at 55-59 and one point of Genesis at 60."] = "練功期間打地城的野性獵豹配置：從背後用撕碎（有撕碎攻擊時，每點能量的效益勝過爪擊），掃擊和撕扯。先點兇暴，15-17級點激怒，18級點野性迅捷，19級點厚皮，20-22級點撕碎攻擊，23-26級點鋒利獸爪和野蠻暴怒，27-29級點猛獸攻擊，30級點獸群領袖，31-32級點血之狂暴，33級點 Natural Instinct，34級點 Predatory Discipline，35-39級點碎裂撕扯，40級點 Shifting Power。然後40多級點恢復系的野性之心和強化治療之觸，51級起點自然變身，接著 Natural Instinct 的第二點，55-59級點自然反應，60級點一點起源。"
L["Balance caster for dungeons while leveling (35 Balance / 16 Restoration). Improved Wrath first, Moonglow at 15-16 and 19, Nature's Reach at 17-18, then Heart of the Wild at 20-24 and Reflection at 25-27 from Restoration for mana, with Naturalist in the late 20s and 30s. Improved Moonfire at 30 and 32, Nature's Majesty, Nature's Splendor at 37, Improved Starfire at 38-42, Eclipse at 43-45, Moonfury at 48-52 and Moonkin Form at 53, then Vengeance, Natural Shapeshifter and Nature's Grace at 60. Moonfire on bosses, Starfire to fill; from 40, Hurricane on packs once the tank holds them."] = "練功期間打地城的平衡施法者配置（平衡 35 / 恢復 16）。先點強化憤怒，15-16級和19級點月光，17-18級點自然延伸，然後為了法力點恢復系：20-24級點野性之心，25-27級點反射，20多級後段和30多級點強化治療之觸。30級和32級點強化月火術，接著自然威嚴，37級點自然光采，38-42級點強化星火術，43-45級點蝕星蔽月，48-52級點月怒，53級點梟獸形態，然後復仇、自然變身，60級點自然之賜。首領用月火術，用星火術填補；40級起，坦克穩住整群怪後用颶風。"
L["Restoration for healing dungeons while leveling (Restoration 36 / Balance 15). Keep Rejuvenation rolling on the tank, Regrowth when it drops low, Healing Touch for big hits. Heart of the Wild first, Reflection at 15-17 for mana while casting, Bloom at 20 (an expiring Rejuvenation or Regrowth heals for your Spirit), then Gift of Nature, Tranquil Spirit and Living Spirit. Genesis at 35-39 from Balance, Improved Wrath at 44-46 (a cheaper, faster Wrath for when the tank needs no healing), Swiftmend at 48 and Improved Regrowth at 50-54."] = "練功期間在地城治療的恢復配置（恢復36 / 平衡15）。對坦克持續保持回春術，血量變低時用癒合，大傷害時用治療之觸。先點野性之心，15-17級點反射以在施法時回復法力，20級點綻放（回春術或癒合結束時會依你的精神進行治療），然後自然賜福、寧靜之魂和活化精神。35-39級點平衡系的起源，44-46級點強化憤怒（坦克不需要治療時，憤怒更便宜、更快），48級點迅癒，50-54級點強化癒合。"
L["Tanking groups through dungeons in Bear Form (Feral 31 / Balance 10 / Restoration 10): Maul on most swings, Swipe on packs, Demoralizing Roar. Ferocity first, Feral Instinct at 15-17, Furor at 18-19, Sharpened Claws and Savage Fury at 20-23, Predatory Strikes at 25-27, Blood Frenzy at 28-29 and Leader of the Pack at 30, then Natural Instinct at 31-32, Feral Swiftness at 34 and Natural Reaction at 35-39. From 40: Genesis, Nature's Reach and Nature's Majesty from Balance, then Nature's Focus and Naturalist from Restoration, with one point of Improved Wrath at 59."] = "用熊形態在地城中為隊伍坦怪的配置（野性戰鬥 31 / 平衡 10 / 恢復 10）：大多數攻擊用槌擊，成群的怪用揮擊，再加上挫志咆哮。先點兇暴，15-17級點野性本能，18-19級點激怒，20-23級點鋒利獸爪和野蠻暴怒，25-27級點猛獸攻擊，28-29級點血之狂暴，30級點獸群領袖，然後31-32級點 Natural Instinct，34級點野性迅捷，35-39級點自然反應。40級起：平衡系的起源、自然延伸和自然威嚴，然後恢復系的自然集中和強化治療之觸，59級點一點強化憤怒。"
L["Affliction: Drain Life Solo"] = "痛苦：吸取生命單人"
L["Fury with a two-handed weapon for questing alone (an alternative to Fury: Solo Leveling, which dual-wields), about 14% slower than the fastest Warrior solo build (Fury 50 / Arms 1). Slam with spare rage, Bloodthirst on cooldown from 40, Whirlwind on packs, Execute to finish. Cruelty first, Unbridled Wrath at 15-19, Enrage at 20-24, Death Wish at 30, Flurry from 35, Improved Whirlwind at 36-37, Bloodthirst at 40, then Booming Voice and Lingering Rage, with Furious Precision, Dual Wield Specialization and Deflection as filler (the off-hand talents do nothing for a two-hander)."] = "單人解任務的雙手武器狂怒配置（狂怒：單人練功的替代方案，後者使用雙持），比戰士最快的單人配置慢約14%（狂怒50 / 武器1）。多餘怒氣用猛擊，40級起冷卻好就用嗜血，成群怪用旋風斬，最後用斬殺收尾。先點殘忍，15-19級點怒不可遏，20-24級點狂怒，30級點死亡之願，35級起點亂舞，36-37級點強化旋風斬，40級點嗜血，然後震耳嗓音和Lingering Rage，並以Furious Precision、雙武器專精和偏斜補點（副手天賦對雙手武器沒有作用）。"
L["Combat with two swords for questing alone (an alternative to Combat: Solo Leveling, which plays maces), about 1% slower than the fastest Rogue solo build (31 Combat / 19 Assassination / 1 Subtlety). Sinister Strike and Eviscerate, Shank on cooldown from 24, Slice and Dice on longer fights. Efficient Strikes and Coup de Grace first, Riposte at 20, Flawless Execution at 25, Weapon Expertise, Aggression and Dual Wield Specialization by 32, Blade Flurry at 34, Flash of Steel at 35-39, Adrenaline Rush at 40, then Malice, Ruthlessness, Vigor, Improved Slice and Dice, Lethality and Cold Blood."] = "單人解任務的雙劍戰鬥配置（戰鬥：單人練功的替代方案，後者使用錘），比盜賊最快的單人配置慢約1%（戰鬥31 / 刺殺19 / 敏銳1）。邪惡攻擊和剔骨，24級起冷卻好就用敲擊，較長的戰鬥用切割。先點Efficient Strikes和憐憫之擊，20級點還擊，25級點完美處決，32級前點武器專家、侵略和雙武器專精，34級點劍刃亂舞，35-39級點Flash of Steel，40級點能量刺激，然後惡意、無情、精力、強化切割、致命偷襲和冷血。"
L["Combat with daggers for questing alone, an alternative to Combat: Solo Leveling (maces), about 11% slower than the fastest Rogue solo build. Sinister Strike and Eviscerate, Shank on cooldown from 24, Slice and Dice on longer fights, Blade Flurry and Adrenaline Rush on harder pulls. Efficient Strikes and Coup de Grace first, Riposte at 20, Flawless Execution at 25, Aggression and Dual Wield Specialization by 32, Hack and Slash from 33 (more crit with daggers), Blade Flurry at 34, Flash of Steel at 35-39, Adrenaline Rush at 40, then Malice, Ruthlessness and Setup."] = "單人解任務的匕首戰鬥配置，是戰鬥：單人練功（錘）的替代方案，比盜賊最快的單人配置慢約11%。邪惡攻擊和剔骨，24級起冷卻好就用敲擊，較長的戰鬥用切割，較難的拉怪用劍刃亂舞和能量刺激。先點Efficient Strikes和憐憫之擊，20級點還擊，25級點完美處決，32級前點侵略和雙武器專精，33級起點劈斬（匕首致命一擊更高），34級點劍刃亂舞，35-39級點Flash of Steel，40級點能量刺激，然後惡意、無情和調整。"
L["Assassination with daggers for questing alone, an alternative to Assassination: Solo Leveling (swords), about 16% slower than the fastest Rogue solo build. Sinister Strike and Eviscerate with poisons, Shank on cooldown from 24, then Mutilate from 52. Remorseless Attacks and Efficient Strikes first, Malice at 14-18, Coup de Grace at 19-21, Precision, Ruthlessness and Deflection in the 20s, Cold Blood at 37, Vile Poisons from 38, Venom at 42, Relentless Strikes at 43-47, Seal Fate at 48-50, then Mutilate with Puncturing Wounds and Flawless Execution."] = "單人解任務的匕首刺殺配置，是刺殺：單人練功（劍）的替代方案，比盜賊最快的單人配置慢約16%。上毒藥後用邪惡攻擊和剔骨，24級起冷卻好就用敲擊，52級起用截肢。先點冷酷攻擊和Efficient Strikes，14-18級點惡意，19-21級點憐憫之擊，20多級點精確、無情和偏斜，37級點冷血，38級起點惡性毒藥，42級點毒液，43-47級點無情打擊，48-50級點封印命運，然後截肢搭配刺傷和完美處決。"
L["Subtlety with swords for questing alone (Subtlety: Solo Leveling plays daggers), about 3% slower than the fastest Rogue solo build. Open from stealth with Garrote or Cheap Shot (Ambush needs a dagger), then Sinister Strike, Shank from 24, Ghostly Strike and Eviscerate, Hemorrhage from 48. Setup and Efficient Strikes first, Opportunity, Dirty Deeds at 16-17 (Garrote from the front), Camouflage, Initiative at 24, Premeditation at 25, Ghostly Strike at 26, then Combat: Coup de Grace, Precision, Deflection, Riposte at 36 and Flawless Execution at 45. Improved Ambush in the 50s only opens Boot Knife."] = "單人解任務的劍敏銳配置（敏銳：單人練功使用匕首），比盜賊最快的單人配置慢約3%。從潛行中用絞喉或偷襲開場（伏擊需要匕首），然後邪惡攻擊、24級起用敲擊，以及鬼魅攻擊和剔骨，48級起用出血。先點調整和Efficient Strikes，接著伺機而動，16-17級點陰險動作（可從正面絞喉），接著偽裝，24級點先發制人，25級點預謀，26級點鬼魅攻擊，然後點戰鬥：憐憫之擊、精確、偏斜，36級點還擊，45級點完美處決。50多級點的強化伏擊只是為了解鎖Boot Knife。"
L["Combat with swords or maces for dungeons while leveling, a slower alternative to Combat: Dungeon Leveling (daggers); both weapon types take the same talents. Sinister Strike, Eviscerate, Slice and Dice, Blade Flurry on packs. Efficient Strikes and Coup de Grace first, Precision at 15-17, Lightning Reflexes and Composure around 20, Flawless Execution at 25, Aggression at 26-28, Blade Flurry at 30, Dual Wield Specialization at 31-32, Hack and Slash from 34, Flash of Steel at 35-39 and Adrenaline Rush at 40. Then Puncturing Wounds at 45-47 (it does nothing with swords or maces), Deflection, Endurance, Riposte at 53, then Setup and Opportunity in the Subtlety tree and a point of Malice."] = "練功期間打地城使用劍或錘的戰鬥配置，是戰鬥：地城練功（匕首）的較慢替代方案；兩種武器點的天賦相同。邪惡攻擊、剔骨、切割，成群的怪用劍刃亂舞。先點Efficient Strikes和憐憫之擊，15-17級點精確，20級左右點閃電反射和Composure，25級點完美處決，26-28級點侵略，30級點劍刃亂舞，31-32級點雙武器專精，34級起點劈斬，35-39級點Flash of Steel，40級點能量刺激。然後45-47級點刺傷（使用劍或錘時沒有作用），接著偏斜、耐久，53級點還擊，然後點敏銳系的調整和伺機而動，以及一點惡意。"
L["Assassination with two swords for dungeons while leveling, a slower alternative to Assassination: Dungeon Leveling (daggers): Sinister Strike, Eviscerate and poisons. Malice and Efficient Strikes first, Improved Slice and Dice at 17-18, Coup de Grace at 19-21, Precision in the early 20s, Remorseless Attacks at 26-27, Vigor, Ruthlessness at 30-32, Cold Blood at 33, Vile Poisons at 34-37 and Venom at 38. Combat after: Deflection, Composure and Endurance in the 40s, Flawless Execution at 46, Aggression at 47-49, Weapon Expertise, Blade Flurry at 51 for packs and Dual Wield Specialization, then Relentless Strikes and a point of Seal Fate at 60."] = "練功期間打地城使用雙劍的刺殺配置，是刺殺：地城練功（匕首）的較慢替代方案：邪惡攻擊、剔骨和毒藥。先點惡意和Efficient Strikes，17-18級點強化切割，19-21級點憐憫之擊，20級出頭點精確，26-27級點冷酷攻擊，接著精力，30-32級點無情，33級點冷血，34-37級點惡性毒藥，38級點毒液。之後點戰鬥系：40多級點偏斜、Composure和耐久，46級點完美處決，47-49級點侵略，接著武器專家，51級點劍刃亂舞對付成群的怪，接著雙武器專精，然後無情打擊，60級點一點封印命運。"
L["Subtlety with swords for dungeons while leveling, a slower alternative to Subtlety: Dungeon Leveling (daggers): Sinister Strike, Ghostly Strike from 33 and Eviscerate. Ambush needs a dagger, so Improved Ambush at 20-22 only opens the next Subtlety tier. Opportunity, Efficient Strikes and Coup de Grace first, Precision, Camouflage, Dirty Deeds at 26-27, Serrated Blades at 28-30, Initiative, then Ghostly Strike at 33, Premeditation at 37 and Hemorrhage at 38. Combat after: Deflection, Composure, Endurance, Riposte at 45, Flawless Execution at 46, Weapon Expertise, Aggression, Blade Flurry at 51 for packs, Setup and Dual Wield Specialization, then Preparation at 58 and Boot Knife at 59-60."] = "練功期間打地城使用劍的敏銳配置，是敏銳：地城練功（匕首）的較慢替代方案：邪惡攻擊、33級起的鬼魅攻擊和剔骨。伏擊需要匕首，所以20-22級的強化伏擊只是用來開啟下一層敏銳天賦。先點伺機而動、Efficient Strikes和憐憫之擊，接著精確、偽裝，26-27級點陰險動作，28-30級點鋸刃，接著先發制人，然後33級點鬼魅攻擊，37級點預謀，38級點出血。之後點戰鬥系：偏斜、Composure、耐久，45級點還擊，46級點完美處決，接著武器專家、侵略，51級點劍刃亂舞對付成群的怪，接著調整和雙武器專精，然後58級點伺機待發，59-60級點Boot Knife。"
L["Beast Mastery in melee for questing alone, a variant of Beast Mastery: Solo Leveling: you fight beside your pet with a two-hander or two one-handers and Raptor Strike instead of shooting, about 21% slower than the fastest Hunter solo build. Deadly Aspects first, Improved Aspect of the Monkey at 15-17, Pathfinding at 20-21, Unleashed Fury from 22 and Ferocity from 26, then Spirit Bond, Bestial Discipline, Frenzy at 35-37, Intimidation at 39 and Bestial Wrath at 40. Marksmanship after: Lethal Attacks, Summon Hawk at 44, Improved Stings at 50-52, Careful Aim at 53-56 and Efficiency at 57-59."] = "單人解任務的近戰野獸控制配置，是野獸控制：單人練功的變體：你拿雙手武器或兩把單手武器在寵物身旁用猛禽一擊作戰，而不是遠程射擊，比獵人最快的單人配置慢約21%。先點致命守護，15-17級點強化靈猴守護，20-21級點尋路，22級起點狂怒釋放，26級起點兇暴，然後靈魂聯結、野獸戒律，35-37級點狂亂，39級點脅迫，40級點狂野怒火。之後點射擊：致命攻擊，44級點召喚獵鷹，50-52級點強化釘刺，53-56級點仔細瞄準，57-59級點效率。"
L["Marksmanship in melee for questing alone (an alternative to Marksmanship: Solo Leveling): Raptor Strike beside your pet instead of shooting. About 26% slower than the fastest Hunter solo build in our model. Lethal Attacks and Careful Aim first, Improved Stings at 20-22, Efficiency, Rapid Killing at 25-26, Deadly Aspects, Focused Fire, Endurance Training at 33-35, Pathfinding and Unleashed Fury from 37. Summon Hawk at 41, the rest of Efficiency, Ferocity, Improved Arcane Shot from 50, Bestial Discipline and Spirit Bond, and Ranged Weapon Specialization at 59."] = "單人解任務的近戰射擊配置（射擊：單人練功的替代方案）：在寵物身旁用猛禽一擊，而不是遠程射擊。在我們的模型中比最快的獵人單人配置慢約26%。先點致命攻擊和仔細瞄準，20-22級點強化釘刺，接著效率，25-26級點急速殺戮，接著致命守護、專注之火，33-35級點耐久訓練，接著尋路，37級起點狂怒釋放。41級點召喚獵鷹，接著效率的剩餘點數、兇暴，50級起點強化秘法射擊，接著野獸戒律和靈魂聯結，59級點遠程武器專精。"
L["Survival in melee for questing alone (an alternative to Survival: Solo Leveling, which shoots): Raptor Strike and Strider Kick beside your pet. The fastest melee Hunter build in our model, about 15% slower than the fastest Hunter solo build. Improved Tracking first, Savage Strikes, Deflection, Clever Traps at 20-21, Surefooted at 22-24 and Predator's Edge at 25-29, then Resourcefulness, Strider Kick at 31, Expose Prey, Survivalist's Discipline, then Deadly Aspects at 37-41. Beast Mastery after: Focused Fire, Endurance Training, Pathfinding, Unleashed Fury from 49, Summon Hawk at 52, Ferocity, Spirit Bond and Bestial Discipline."] = "單人解任務的近戰生存配置（生存：單人練功的替代方案，後者使用遠程射擊）：在寵物身旁用猛禽一擊和陸行鳥腳踢。在我們的模型中是最快的近戰獵人配置，比最快的獵人單人配置慢約15%。先點強化追蹤，接著猛烈強擊、偏斜，20-21級點靈巧陷阱，22-24級點穩固，25-29級點掠食者優勢，然後足智多謀，31級點陸行鳥腳踢，接著暴露獵物、生存專家戒律，然後37-41級點致命守護。之後點野獸控制：專注之火、耐久訓練、尋路，49級起點狂怒釋放，52級點召喚獵鷹，接著兇暴、靈魂聯結和野獸戒律。"
L["Beast Mastery in melee for dungeons while leveling (an alternative to Beast Mastery: Dungeon Leveling): Raptor Strike behind the mob with your pet, about 29% slower than the shooting build in our model. Deadly Aspects first, Focused Fire, Endurance Training at 17-19, Unleashed Fury at 20-24, Summon Hawk at 25 and Ferocity from 26, then Bestial Discipline, Bestial Swiftness, Intimidation at 34, Frenzy at 35-39 and Bestial Wrath at 40. Marksmanship after: Hawk Eye, Improved Concussive Shot, Careful Aim from 46, Improved Stings, Efficiency and Rapid Killing, then Lethal Attacks at 60."] = "練功期間打地城的近戰野獸控制配置（野獸控制：地城練功的替代方案）：和寵物一起在怪物背後使用猛禽一擊，在我們的模型中比遠程射擊配置慢約29%。先點致命守護，接著專注之火，17-19級點耐久訓練，20-24級點狂怒釋放，25級點召喚獵鷹，26級起點兇暴，然後野獸戒律、野獸迅捷，34級點脅迫，35-39級點狂亂，40級點狂野怒火。之後點射擊：鷹眼、強化震盪射擊，46級起點仔細瞄準，接著強化釘刺、效率和急速殺戮，然後60級點致命攻擊。"
L["Marksmanship in melee for dungeons while leveling (an alternative to Marksmanship: Dungeon Leveling): Raptor Strike behind the mob with your pet, about 51% slower than the shooting build in our model. Lethal Attacks and Careful Aim first, Improved Stings at 20-22, Improved Tracking at 23-26, Deadly Aspects at 27-31, Focused Fire, Endurance Training, then Unleashed Fury from 37. Then Efficiency, Summon Hawk at 45, Ferocity, Hawk Eye, Bestial Discipline and Barrage, with Improved Concussive Shot at 59."] = "練功期間打地城的近戰射擊配置（射擊：地城練功的替代方案）：和寵物一起在怪物背後使用猛禽一擊，在我們的模型中比遠程射擊配置慢約51%。先點致命攻擊和仔細瞄準，20-22級點強化釘刺，23-26級點強化追蹤，27-31級點致命守護，接著專注之火、耐久訓練，然後37級起點狂怒釋放。然後點效率，45級點召喚獵鷹，接著兇暴、鷹眼、野獸戒律和彈幕，59級點強化震盪射擊。"
L["Survival in melee for dungeons while leveling (an alternative to Survival: Dungeon Leveling, which shoots): Raptor Strike and Strider Kick behind the mob. The fastest melee Hunter in groups in our model, about 19% slower than shooting. Improved Tracking first, Savage Strikes, Deflection, Clever Traps, Surefooted at 22-24 and Predator's Edge at 25-29, then Strider Kick at 30, Resourcefulness, Expose Prey, Survivalist's Discipline at 35-36 and Deadly Aspects at 37-41. Beast Mastery after: Focused Fire, Endurance Training, Unleashed Fury at 47-51, Summon Hawk at 52, Ferocity and Bestial Discipline, then Lethal Attacks."] = "練功期間打地城的近戰生存配置（生存：地城練功的替代方案，後者使用遠程射擊）：在怪物背後使用猛禽一擊和陸行鳥腳踢。在我們的模型中是組隊時最快的近戰獵人，比遠程射擊慢約19%。先點強化追蹤，接著猛烈強擊、偏斜、靈巧陷阱，22-24級點穩固，25-29級點掠食者優勢，然後30級點陸行鳥腳踢，接著足智多謀、暴露獵物，35-36級點生存專家戒律，37-41級點致命守護。之後點野獸控制：專注之火、耐久訓練，47-51級點狂怒釋放，52級點召喚獵鷹，接著兇暴和野獸戒律，然後致命攻擊。"
L["Arcane for AoE grinding, a variant that pulls packs, about 44% slower than the fastest Mage solo build (Frost: AoE Leveling), but about 10% faster than Arcane: Solo Leveling. Until Improved Blizzard you kill one or two mobs with Arcane Missiles (Arcane Blast first from 22); from 36 you pull packs, Frost Nova, then Blizzard them down. Arcane Concentration from 17, Missile Barrage at 20 and Arcane Wrath at 27. Frost from 29: Frostbite at 33-35, Improved Blizzard at 36-38 and Shatter at 44-46. Arcane Mind from 49 and Arcane Instability at 57-59 finish it."] = "用於範圍練功的秘法配置，是會拉一群怪的變體，比法師最快的單人配置（冰霜：範圍練功）慢約44%，但比秘法：單人練功快約10%。在學到強化暴風雪前，用秘法飛彈一次殺一兩隻怪（22級起先用秘法衝擊）；36級起拉一群怪，先冰霜新星，再用暴風雪清掉。17級起點秘法專注，20級點飛彈彈幕，27級點秘法懲戒。29級起點冰霜：33-35級點霜寒刺骨，36-38級點強化暴風雪，44-46級點碎冰。最後49級起點秘法心智，57-59級點秘法增效。"
L["Demonology for questing alone, about 13% slower than the fastest Warlock solo build, played as a Drain Life tank: one mob a pull comes to you and you drain it, while the Voidwalker (until 20) and then the Succubus add damage without tanking. From 48, Demonic Pact lets you sacrifice the Felhunter for 3% of your health every 4 sec and keep the Succubus out. Unholy Power and Suppression first, Soul Harvest at 21, Improved Sayaad at 28-30, Demonic Brand at 33-34, Soul Link at 38, Master Demonologist at 43-47, then Fel Concentration and Pandemic."] = "單人解任務的惡魔學識配置，比術士最快的單人配置慢約13%，以吸取生命坦怪的方式玩：每次拉一隻怪讓牠靠近你，由你吸取牠，虛空行者（20級前）和之後的魅魔只增加傷害、不坦怪。48級起，惡魔契印讓你犧牲地獄獵犬獲得每4秒回復3%生命力的效果，並在魅魔出場時保留這個加成。先點邪惡強化和鎮壓，21級點靈魂收割，28-30級點強化薩亞德，33-34級點惡魔烙印，38級點靈魂鏈結，43-47級點惡魔學識大師，然後惡魔專注和災疫。"
L["Arcane: AoE Leveling"] = "秘法：範圍練功"
