L["Survival: Melee Solo"] = "生存：近戰單人"
L["Maximum Protection (46 / 5 Retribution) for raid tanking: the most mitigation of the Protection builds, so pick it over Vanguard when surviving matters more than threat. Holy Strike, Judgement and Holy Shield on cooldown. Redoubt, Anticipation, Toughness, Improved Righteous Fury, Holy Shield, Iron Creed, Shieldsworn and Reckoning carry it; Swift Judgement, Improved Hammer of Justice and Guardian's Favor fill the late points, with Deflection from Retribution."] = "用於團隊坦克的極限防護（46 / 懲戒5）：防護配置中減傷最高的一套，所以當生存比仇恨更重要時，選它而不是先鋒。冷卻好就用神聖打擊、審判和神聖之盾。盾牌壁壘、預知、堅韌、強化正義之怒、神聖之盾、鐵之教條、Shieldsworn和清算是核心；迅捷審判、強化裁決之錘和守護者的寵愛補上後期點數，再加上懲戒系的偏斜。"
L["A Holy Strike tank like Vanguard, but with no Reckoning or Vindication: more Toughness and Benediction instead. Shieldsworn at 47 makes Holy Strike hit with your shield, setting off Holy Shield and Shield Specialization; Sacred Arbiter makes it refresh your Judgements, and Iron Creed adds threat and damage reduction. Redoubt, Anticipation, Toughness and Holy Shield for defence, with Deflection, Conviction, Improved Judgement and Benediction from Retribution. Holy Strike, Judgement and Holy Shield on cooldown."] = "與先鋒一樣以神聖打擊為主的坦克，但不點清算或辯護，改點更多堅韌和祈福。47級的Shieldsworn讓神聖打擊以你的盾牌攻擊，觸發神聖之盾和盾牌專精；神聖仲裁者讓它刷新你的審判，鐵之教條則增加仇恨和減傷。防禦方面點盾牌壁壘、預知、堅韌和神聖之盾，再加上懲戒系的偏斜、定罪、強化審判和祈福。冷卻好就用神聖打擊、審判和神聖之盾。"
L["Affliction: Maraudon Princess Farming"] = "痛苦：瑪拉頓公主刷怪"
L["Arcane: Dire Maul East Lasher Farming"] = "秘法：厄運之槌東區鞭笞者刷怪"
L["Beast Mastery: Dire Maul North Tribute Farming"] = "野獸控制：厄運之槌北區貢品刷怪"
L["Elemental: Dire Maul East Jump Run Farming"] = "元素：厄運之槌東區跳躍路線刷怪"
